GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "129", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A racing vehicle speeds down a dirt road lined with a crowd of people, as a horn honks and wind blows into the microphone.", "pred": "A dark blue rally car with green wheels speeds along a dirt track, creating a loud engine roar, significant wind noise, and a metallic screeching sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A dark blue rally car with green wheels speeds along a dirt track, creating a loud engine roar, significant wind noise, and a metallic screeching sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio reveals the distinct sound of a vehicle engine revving loudly, accompanied by prominent wind noise and a high-pitched metallic screech, suggesting a car is accelerating rapidly, possibly losing traction on a loose surface.\nThe audio contains the loud, high-pitched engine revving of a vehicle, strong wind noise, and a sudden, high-frequency metallic screech, indicating rapid acceleration and a loss of traction.\nThe audio contains the loud, high-pitched engine revving of a vehicle, strong wind noise, and a sudden, high-frequency metallic screech, indicating rapid acceleration and a loss of traction.\n\nA dark blue rally car with green wheels speeds along a dirt track, creating a loud engine roar, significant wind noise, and a metallic screeching sound.", "time_sec": 284.994, "generation_time_seconds": 198.7502, "selection_time_seconds": 83.7721, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "130", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the man talks with a slide whistle sound, typing on a keyboard and mouse clicking, woodwind music plays in the background, a ship sails through the game with pirate ships in sight.", "pred": "A glitch-art visual of fragmented pixel blocks overlays a clear male voice saying \"Snowflake,\" followed by \"Okay, attack, use adjective,\" and a sustained electronic buzz.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A glitch-art visual of fragmented pixel blocks overlays a clear male voice saying \"Snowflake,\" followed by \"Okay, attack, use adjective,\" and a sustained electronic buzz.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains a person speaking, while the video displays a pixelated, abstract, and fragmented image resembling glitched computer graphics or corrupted data.\nThe person says \"Snowflake\" followed by \"Okay, attack, use adjective,\" while the screen shows a chaotic, pixelated collage of abstract shapes and patterns, including horizontal and vertical lines, squares, and pixel clusters in colors like brown, green, yellow, and black against a light blue background.\nThe scene displays a glitch-art aesthetic with fragmented, pixelated blocks and horizontal stripes in yellow, brown, green, and black. Overlaid on this visual is a clear, close-miked male voice speaking the words \"Snowflake,\" followed by the command \"Okay, attack, use adjective,\" and then a prolonged electronic buzzing sound.\n\nA glitch-art visual of fragmented pixel blocks overlays a clear male voice saying \"Snowflake,\" followed by \"Okay, attack, use adjective,\" and a sustained electronic buzz.", "time_sec": 249.648, "generation_time_seconds": 162.6612, "selection_time_seconds": 84.2475, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "131", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The baby cries as a woman speaks, while a little girl in a pink dress sits on a red chair with a small child.", "pred": "A distorted video with horizontal glitch bars overlays an indistinct background as a baby cries and a woman speaks.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A distorted video with horizontal glitch bars overlays an indistinct background as a baby cries and a woman speaks.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video shows a distorted, horizontal bar glitch effect over a blurry, indistinct background, while the audio consists of a baby crying and a woman speaking.\nThe visual stream is compromised by severe digital distortion, specifically horizontal bar artifacts of varying width and color (brown, green, grey), which obscure a blurry background scene.\nThe audio is present and contains a baby crying and a woman speaking.\nThe visual and auditory streams are inconsistent; the video shows digital distortion while the audio suggests a domestic scene.\nThe visual scene is completely obscured by the glitch effect, providing no discernible detail about the environment or the people in the audio.\nThe final answer must be a single sentence combining the observed visual and auditory information.\n\nA distorted video with horizontal glitch bars overlays an indistinct background as a baby cries and a woman speaks.", "time_sec": 289.952, "generation_time_seconds": 203.4167, "selection_time_seconds": 84.1231, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 32.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "132", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As a woman speaks affectionately, a pig oinks  on the bed.", "pred": "A severely corrupted digital video displaying horizontal block lines and scrambled pixelated textures is accompanied by a female voice speaking followed by a squeak.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A severely corrupted digital video displaying horizontal block lines and scrambled pixelated textures is accompanied by a female voice speaking followed by a squeak.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe digital corruption, manifesting as horizontal block lines and scrambled, pixelated frames in dark, earthy tones, while the audio captures a person speaking followed by a distinct squeaking sound.\nThe visual stream is a corrupted digital video, showing persistent horizontal block artifacts and severe pixelation across the frame, with no discernible objects, actions, or environment. The audio stream contains a female voice speaking two phrases, immediately followed by a sharp, high-pitched squeak.\nThe visual is a corrupted digital video stream characterized by horizontal black bands and scrambled, pixelated blocks of brown, green, and black texture, with no coherent scene. The audio consists of a female voice saying two short phrases, immediately followed by a brief, high-pitched squeaking sound.\n\nA severely corrupted digital video displaying horizontal block lines and scrambled pixelated textures is accompanied by a female voice speaking followed by a squeak.", "time_sec": 244.897, "generation_time_seconds": 159.2958, "selection_time_seconds": 83.4529, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "133", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A black sports car speeds down a curvy road with the sound of humming and revving engine, accompanied by squealing tires.", "pred": "A heavily pixelated outdoor scene with green foliage and a structure is paired with the audio of a car's tires screeching and its engine revving loudly.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated outdoor scene with green foliage and a structure is paired with the audio of a car's tires screeching and its engine revving loudly.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a distorted, fragmented image of an outdoor setting with green foliage and a building, while the audio features the loud, high-pitched screech of tires and the sound of a vehicle accelerating and shifting gears.\nThe visual output is severely corrupted, appearing as a mosaic of moving, fragmented rectangular blocks with a dark, possibly wooded, vertical pattern on the left and a lighter, horizontal pattern on the right, suggesting an outdoor environment. This visual instability is juxtaposed with a loud, high-pitched audio track dominated by the distinct sounds of a vehicle's tires screeching and the engine revving aggressively.\nThe video frame is a heavily pixelated and corrupted mosaic of green foliage and a light-colored structure, while the audio is dominated by the sound of a car's tires screeching and its engine revving loudly.\n\nA heavily pixelated outdoor scene with green foliage and a structure is paired with the audio of a car's tires screeching and its engine revving loudly.", "time_sec": 304.393, "generation_time_seconds": 218.7592, "selection_time_seconds": 83.6692, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "134", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A child and a man engage in conversation as bird sounds fill the air, including a bird in a cage on the roof of a building and a broken cage on the roof of a building.", "pred": "A heavily pixelated and corrupted image of a glass building under a blue sky accompanies the audio of a man speaking in Spanish and a baby crying.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated and corrupted image of a glass building under a blue sky accompanies the audio of a man speaking in Spanish and a baby crying.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image is a heavily distorted, pixelated, and fragmented collage of a modern glass-and-steel building facade under a blue sky, with the audio featuring a man speaking in Spanish and the distinct, high-pitched wailing of a baby crying.\nThe visual data consists of a corrupted, blocky, and scrambled image of a contemporary glass building facade and a blue sky. The audio data captures a man speaking in Spanish and the sound of a baby crying.\nThe visual content is a digital artifact, characterized by horizontal banding, pixelation, and scrambled blocks of color and texture that fragment the image of a building and sky. The auditory content comprises two distinct and simultaneous sound sources: a male voice speaking in Spanish and the high-pitched vocalizations of an infant.\n\nA heavily pixelated and corrupted image of a glass building under a blue sky accompanies the audio of a man speaking in Spanish and a baby crying.", "time_sec": 260.845, "generation_time_seconds": 174.516, "selection_time_seconds": 83.9437, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "135", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man's voice narrates as he cuts wood with a knife on a wooden table, followed by the sound of paper shuffling.", "pred": "A person describes cutting a material with a tool, accompanied by the sound of sawing, while a high-pitched sustained electronic whine is audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A person describes cutting a material with a tool, accompanied by the sound of sawing, while a high-pitched sustained electronic whine is audible.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual consists of a static, pixelated, and vertically striped pattern with a warm, brownish-tan color scheme, while the audio captures a person speaking, a high-pitched electronic whine, and the sound of a saw cutting through a material.\nA static, pixelated image of a brownish-tan, vertically striped surface is paired with a person speaking, a high-pitched electronic whine, and the sound of a saw cutting.\nThe visual field is entirely composed of a mosaic of distorted, vertically aligned rectangular blocks, creating a fragmented and abstract pattern in shades of beige and brown.\nThe audio features a person speaking in a neutral, instructional tone, followed immediately by a sustained, high-pitched electronic whine.\nConcurrently with the whine, the distinct, rhythmic sound of a saw cutting through a material is audible.\nThe cutting sound ceases abruptly as the speaker resumes talking.\nTherefore, the audio describes the process of sawing something while a high-pitched electronic noise is present.\n\nA person describes cutting a material with a tool, accompanied by the sound of sawing, while a high-pitched sustained electronic whine is audible.", "time_sec": 270.863, "generation_time_seconds": 185.9837, "selection_time_seconds": 82.614, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "136", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the intense video game scene, clicks, gunshots, and breathing are heard as a woman navigates through a cave.", "pred": "A low-resolution, pixelated video game scene shows a dark, blocky environment while audio captures the sounds of automatic gunfire, a male voice saying \"Reload!\", and the metallic clicks of a weapon being reloaded.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A low-resolution, pixelated video game scene shows a dark, blocky environment while audio captures the sounds of automatic gunfire, a male voice saying \"Reload!\", and the metallic clicks of a weapon being reloaded.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual shows a pixelated, low-resolution, dark video game scene resembling a first-person shooter environment, while the audio captures the sounds of automatic gunfire, a male voice announcing \"Reload!\" and the distinct mechanical sounds of a weapon being reloaded.\nThe visual frames display a heavily pixelated and distorted first-person perspective of a video game, with a dark, blocky, and unrecognizable environment. Concurrently, the audio features the rapid, staccato bursts of automatic gunfire followed by the metallic clicks and clanks of a weapon being reloaded, punctuated by a male voice calmly stating \"Reload!\" in a standard American accent.\nThe visual stream consists of a dark, low-resolution, and heavily pixelated image, characteristic of a first-person shooter video game, with no discernible characters, objects, or environment. The audio stream contains the sharp, rapid-fire bursts of automatic gunfire, the clear mechanical sound of a weapon being reloaded, and a male voice calmly stating \"Reload!\" in a standard American English accent.\n\nA low-resolution, pixelated video game scene shows a dark, blocky environment while audio captures the sounds of automatic gunfire, a male voice saying \"Reload!\", and the metallic clicks of a weapon being reloaded.", "time_sec": 326.377, "generation_time_seconds": 240.2496, "selection_time_seconds": 84.1946, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "137", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man stands on a train track , as steam billows out followed by knocking sounds.", "pred": "A high-pitched, sustained mechanical whirring sound plays over a fragmented, horizontally-distorted mosaic of outdoor scenes featuring sky, clouds, green grass, and wooden textures.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A high-pitched, sustained mechanical whirring sound plays over a fragmented, horizontally-distorted mosaic of outdoor scenes featuring sky, clouds, green grass, and wooden textures.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe fragmented video displays a mosaic of outdoor scenes including blue sky, white clouds, green grass, and brown wooden structures, while the audio features a loud, high-pitched, sustained whirring sound, similar to a power tool or a vacuum cleaner, that begins abruptly and continues for the duration of the clip.\nThe audio consists of a high-pitched mechanical whirring sound, starting abruptly at 00:00 with a brief metallic clank, then continuing at a steady, high volume until the end. This sound is characteristic of a motorized device, possibly a power tool or a small engine, in operation. The visual stream is highly fragmented into horizontal bars, showing disjointed, warped segments of what appears to be an outdoor environment, including blue sky, white clouds, green foliage, and brown wooden textures from a structure. The visual and auditory elements are unrelated, with no clear synchronization between the mechanical sound and the scenes.\nThe audio is a loud, high-frequency, continuous mechanical whirring, characteristic of a high-RPM motor or tool like a grinder or vacuum cleaner, beginning abruptly at the start. The visual content consists of a mosaic of distorted, horizontally-stretched video segments, showing a fragmented outdoor scene with blue sky, white clouds, green grass, and brown wooden textures. The two sensory streams are temporally aligned but semantically disconnected, with no visual source for the prominent sound.\n\nA high-pitched, sustained mechanical whirring sound plays over a fragmented, horizontally-distorted mosaic of outdoor scenes featuring sky, clouds, green grass, and wooden textures.", "time_sec": 337.007, "generation_time_seconds": 250.5948, "selection_time_seconds": 83.6654, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "138", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As a man talks, footsteps on dirt are heard amidst buzzing insects and chirping birds, while a beekeeper inspects a frame of bees inside a wooden beehive.", "pred": "A glitching abstract pattern of diagonal lines and colored blocks overlays a male voice speaking Polish, layered with sharp metallic clicks and fabric rustling.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A glitching abstract pattern of diagonal lines and colored blocks overlays a male voice speaking Polish, layered with sharp metallic clicks and fabric rustling.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream consists of a rapidly shifting, fragmented mosaic of abstract textures and colors, including diagonal lines, speckled patterns, and solid blocks of brown, teal, and beige, creating a glitch-like, non-representational effect. Simultaneously, the audio captures a male voice speaking in Polish, uttering the words \"To można wziąć, cyk,\" accompanied by distinct sounds of fabric rustling and a sharp, metallic click, all layered over a persistent low-frequency ambient hum.\nThe visual data is a dense, non-representational collage of abstract geometric shapes and textures, primarily composed of diagonal lines and speckled patterns in earthy and muted tones, with distinct horizontal bands of solid color (brown, teal, beige) and significant visual noise, creating a pronounced glitch or data corruption aesthetic.\nThe audio reveals a male speaker in Polish saying \"To można wziąć, cyk\" (\"That can be taken, great\"), overlaid with prominent fabric rustling and a sharp metallic click, all set against a low-frequency ambient hum.\n\nA glitching abstract pattern of diagonal lines and colored blocks overlays a male voice speaking Polish, layered with sharp metallic clicks and fabric rustling.", "time_sec": 331.621, "generation_time_seconds": 243.5069, "selection_time_seconds": 84.9943, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "139", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Birds quack amidst passing traffic as they stand on the ground near a small garden with a bird bath and potted plants, while a black bird perches on a fence nearby.", "pred": "A rapidly shifting digital glitch mosaic of colored bars and abstract shapes is accompanied by a continuous, rhythmic metallic ratchet clicking and a low electronic hiss.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A rapidly shifting digital glitch mosaic of colored bars and abstract shapes is accompanied by a continuous, rhythmic metallic ratchet clicking and a low electronic hiss.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a complex, glitching mosaic of vertical and horizontal colored bars, abstract shapes, and fragmented natural images like green foliage and brown textures, creating a dense, digital interference pattern. This visual is accompanied by the prominent, sharp, rhythmic clicking sound of a mechanical ratchet or pawl mechanism operating at a steady pace.\nThe visual stream consists of a rapidly shifting, fragmented digital mosaic composed of vertical and horizontal bars, abstract geometric patterns, and distorted textures resembling green foliage and brown elements, all exhibiting severe digital compression artifacts and glitching. Simultaneously, the audio presents a continuous, high-frequency, metallic clicking sound with a very regular rhythm, consistent with a mechanical ratchet or pawl mechanism in operation, accompanied by a faint, low-level electronic hiss in the background.\nThe primary visual element is a dense, rapidly changing digital glitch effect, composed of horizontal and vertical bands, pixelated patterns, and fragmented natural textures, indicating intense data corruption. This is paired with a very distinct, rhythmic mechanical clicking sound, which is sharp and metallic, suggesting a physical mechanism like a ratchet or pawl, operating in a continuous, repetitive cycle.\n\nA rapidly shifting digital glitch mosaic of colored bars and abstract shapes is accompanied by a continuous, rhythmic metallic ratchet clicking and a low electronic hiss.", "time_sec": 319.291, "generation_time_seconds": 231.8715, "selection_time_seconds": 84.0069, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "140", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the serene setting of nature, a man speaks amidst the chirping of birds and the squeaking of a frog, as a green frog and a snake coexist in the dirt with rocks and plants nearby.", "pred": "A dark, glitching image of fragmented vertical bars with horizontal cyan and green bands is accompanied by a male voice speaking in Mandarin over a constant, high-pitched electronic buzz.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A dark, glitching image of fragmented vertical bars with horizontal cyan and green bands is accompanied by a male voice speaking in Mandarin over a constant, high-pitched electronic buzz.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, pixelated, and fragmented image, primarily composed of dark, vertical, textured elements interspersed with glitching horizontal bands of bright cyan, green, and white, creating a disorienting visual effect.\nThe audio features a male voice speaking in a conversational tone in what sounds like Mandarin Chinese, accompanied by a continuous, high-pitched, electronic buzzing sound, similar to a synthesizer or alarm.\nThe visual is a chaotic, glitch-art composition of fragmented, dark, and textured vertical bars, with horizontal bands of bright, shifting colors creating a sense of digital corruption. Simultaneously, the audio presents a male voice speaking in a calm, conversational tone in Mandarin Chinese, layered over a constant, high-pitched, synthesized buzzing tone.\n\nA dark, glitching image of fragmented vertical bars with horizontal cyan and green bands is accompanied by a male voice speaking in Mandarin over a constant, high-pitched electronic buzz.", "time_sec": 269.779, "generation_time_seconds": 184.8452, "selection_time_seconds": 82.9339, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "141", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two men discuss while an insect buzzes by, wind blows, and birds chirp in the distance, as a person holding a pen  draws a map of the area.", "pred": "A distorted, glitching visual of a document with horizontal lines and color artifacts is accompanied by a person speaking conversationally about spatial dimensions and a channel that curves.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A distorted, glitching visual of a document with horizontal lines and color artifacts is accompanied by a person speaking conversationally about spatial dimensions and a channel that curves.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, glitched, and fragmented sequence of what appears to be a white document with black text and lines, possibly a form or ledger. This visual is accompanied by the sound of a person speaking in a conversational tone about something that \"can't be that wide\" and mentions \"another channel coming up here\" and \"curves.\"\nThe video frames exhibit severe horizontal line distortion and color shifting, creating a fragmented, glitched appearance of a white surface with black text and lines. Simultaneously, a person is heard speaking conversationally about spatial dimensions and a channel that curves.\nThe audio and visual streams are completely independent and unrelated. The audio describes a technical or spatial discussion, while the visual is a corrupted, abstract pattern. There is no semantic or causal link between the spoken words and the glitching on screen.\n\nA distorted, glitching visual of a document with horizontal lines and color artifacts is accompanied by a person speaking conversationally about spatial dimensions and a channel that curves.", "time_sec": 290.932, "generation_time_seconds": 204.2876, "selection_time_seconds": 84.5373, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.25, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "142", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man's voice narrates as a motorcycle accelerates down a narrow road with a blue car following behind.", "pred": "The visual feed is a corrupted mosaic of horizontal static, while the audio features a male speaker with a British accent talking over the continuous whir of a small engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "The visual feed is a corrupted mosaic of horizontal static, while the audio features a male speaker with a British accent talking over the continuous whir of a small engine.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n```\n{\n  \"reasoning\": \"The visual stream is entirely corrupted, displaying a mosaic of horizontal static and fragmented, rapidly changing images of indistinct green and brown textures. The audio stream is clear and features a male speaker with a British accent, who is talking over the continuous, high-pitched whirring sound of a small engine or motor, possibly from a scooter or motorbike.\"\n}\n```\nThe visual feed is a corrupted mosaic of horizontal static and fragmented, rapidly changing textures in green and brown. The audio consists of a male speaker with a British accent, who is talking over the continuous, high-pitched whirring sound of a small engine or motor.\nThe visual stream is entirely corrupted, displaying a mosaic of horizontal static and fragmented, rapidly changing images of indistinct green and brown textures. The audio stream is clear and features a male speaker with a British accent, who is talking over the continuous, high-pitched whirring sound of a small engine or motor, possibly from a scooter or motorbike.\n\nThe visual feed is a corrupted mosaic of horizontal static, while the audio features a male speaker with a British accent talking over the continuous whir of a small engine.", "time_sec": 274.124, "generation_time_seconds": 187.3462, "selection_time_seconds": 84.0571, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "143", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A person on a boat catches a bass with a hook in its mouth, as water splashes, a duck quacks, and the person laughs.", "pred": "The video displays severe horizontal line distortion obscuring the scene, while the audio features clear duck quacks, a splash, and water movement.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "The video displays severe horizontal line distortion obscuring the scene, while the audio features clear duck quacks, a splash, and water movement.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual content is severely degraded, displaying persistent horizontal line artifacts and pixelation across all frames, obscuring any identifiable scene or subject. The audio consists of distinct duck quacks, followed by a splash and the sound of water.\nThe audio reveals clear duck quacking, a splash, and water movement, confirming a waterfowl is present in a body of water. The visual data is non-functional due to severe horizontal line noise, making content identification impossible, thus creating a mismatch between the coherent audio and corrupted video.\nThe video exhibits severe horizontal line artifacts and pixelation, rendering the scene unidentifiable. The audio contains distinct duck quacks, a splash, and water movement.\n\nThe video displays severe horizontal line distortion obscuring the scene, while the audio features clear duck quacks, a splash, and water movement.", "time_sec": 256.032, "generation_time_seconds": 169.3031, "selection_time_seconds": 84.052, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "144", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A crowd of people cheers and applause to the dancers for dance performs on stage.", "pred": "A static, glitch-like visual of dark and smudged colored bands is paired with the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train's wheels on metal rails.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A static, glitch-like visual of dark and smudged colored bands is paired with the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train's wheels on metal rails.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a dark, abstract composition of fragmented, vertically-oriented rectangular bands in black, brown, and beige, with some areas showing smudged red and white patterns, creating a static, glitch-like mosaic. Simultaneously, the audio captures the loud, rhythmic clatter and rumble of a moving train, including the distinct metallic screech of wheels on rails and a powerful low-frequency engine hum.\nThe video displays a static, abstract, and glitch-like mosaic composed of dark, vertically-oriented rectangular bands in black, brown, and beige, with fragmented smudged red and white patterns. Concurrently, the audio features the loud, rhythmic, and metallic clatter of what is clearly a moving train, including the distinct sounds of wheels on tracks and a powerful, low-frequency engine rumble.\nThe visual is a complex, static pattern of vertically-aligned digital artifacts, appearing as dark brown and black rectangular blocks overlaid with areas of smudged red and white textures, resembling a corrupted or compressed digital image. This visual is paired with an audibly dominant and physically present mechanical sound: a loud, rhythmic clatter and low-frequency rumble consistent with heavy train wheels moving on metal rails, accompanied by a high-pitched metallic screech.\n\nA static, glitch-like visual of dark and smudged colored bands is paired with the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train's wheels on metal rails.", "time_sec": 304.279, "generation_time_seconds": 217.737, "selection_time_seconds": 84.1276, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "145", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the bathroom, a man with a beard is shaving on his face,while there is a sink  and water splashing sounds in the background.", "pred": "A heavily corrupted, horizontal striped image of indistinct forms accompanies the sound of a toilet flushing and its tank refilling.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavily corrupted, horizontal striped image of indistinct forms accompanies the sound of a toilet flushing and its tank refilling.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is a heavily corrupted, pixelated mosaic of horizontal bands in brown and beige tones, exhibiting severe digital distortion and motion blur, while the audio captures the sound of a toilet flushing followed by the distinct mechanical sound of a tank refilling.\nThe image is a severe digital artifact, a mosaic of horizontal stripes in sepia and beige with no discernible objects or figures, exhibiting motion blur and pixelation; simultaneously, the audio records a toilet flushing and the subsequent sound of water refilling its tank.\nThe visual information is a chaotic, abstract pattern of horizontal bands in reddish-brown, beige, and white, exhibiting severe pixelation and motion blur, consistent with a video signal error or digital corruption; simultaneously, the audio consists of a toilet flushing and the mechanical refilling of its tank.\n\nA heavily corrupted, horizontal striped image of indistinct forms accompanies the sound of a toilet flushing and its tank refilling.", "time_sec": 270.047, "generation_time_seconds": 183.5036, "selection_time_seconds": 83.9357, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "146", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The hissing spray of a pressure washer cleans the roof as liquid patters on the surface, while a man works diligently atop the metal roof with a squeegee.", "pred": "A heavily pixelated, abstract video collage of white and grey horizontal lines and blocks is paired with a continuous, high-pitched mechanical buzzing sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated, abstract video collage of white and grey horizontal lines and blocks is paired with a continuous, high-pitched mechanical buzzing sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual content is a heavily distorted, pixelated, and fragmented compilation of abstract patterns, including horizontal lines, grids, and what appears to be white tiles or surfaces, all rendered in a monochrome palette of white, grey, and black. Simultaneously, the audio consists of a continuous, high-pitched, and abrasive buzzing or humming sound, similar to a malfunctioning electric toothbrush or a high-speed drill, without any other discernible environmental sounds or speech. The two modalities are unrelated, with the visual being a form of digital glitch and the audio being a sustained mechanical noise.\nThe video displays a severe digital glitch effect, characterized by fragmented, pixelated, and horizontally stacked images with no coherent scene, while the audio captures a continuous, high-frequency buzzing sound, likely from a malfunctioning or high-speed mechanical device.\nThe analysis of the audio reveals a single, sustained, high-pitched buzzing noise, likely from a malfunctioning electric appliance or high-speed motor, with no speech or environmental context. The visual analysis shows a heavily corrupted digital video stream, defined by a pattern of rectangular blocks and horizontal lines, lacking any discernible real-world subject. The two streams are independent and unrelated, with the audio being a pure mechanical sound and the video being a non-representational digital artifact.\n\nA heavily pixelated, abstract video collage of white and grey horizontal lines and blocks is paired with a continuous, high-pitched mechanical buzzing sound.", "time_sec": 324.793, "generation_time_seconds": 237.9071, "selection_time_seconds": 84.7128, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "147", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The helicopter flies low over a field, its engine running idle as the wind blows heavily into the microphone.", "pred": "The video displays significant digital corruption, appearing as rapidly shifting horizontal strips, accompanied by a piercing high-speed mechanical whir layered over intense low-frequency rumbling and rushing air sounds.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays significant digital corruption, appearing as rapidly shifting horizontal strips, accompanied by a piercing high-speed mechanical whir layered over intense low-frequency rumbling and rushing air sounds.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "The video displays significant digital corruption, appearing as rapidly shifting horizontal strips, accompanied by a piercing high-speed mechanical whir layered over intense low-frequency rumbling and rushing air sounds.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays significant digital corruption, appearing as rapidly shifting horizontal strips, accompanied by a piercing high-speed mechanical whir layered over intense low-frequency rumbling and rushing air sounds.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image is a digital composite of multiple horizontal video strips, appearing as a mosaic, possibly created by an object moving rapidly past a camera or a glitch effect. The audio consists of high-pitched, rapid, mechanical whirring, consistent with a small motor or fan spinning at high speed, layered with loud, low-frequency rumbling and whooshing sounds, suggesting strong wind or air displacement.\nThe visual consists of fragmented, rapidly shifting horizontal bands, indicating either a fast-moving object passing in front of the lens or a severe digital glitch disrupting the video stream. This visual chaos is synchronized with an audio landscape dominated by a high-frequency mechanical whirring, overlaid with intense low-frequency rumbling and rushing air sounds. The combination of the chaotic visuals and the powerful, layered sounds strongly suggests the recording was made from a location experiencing extreme turbulence, such as inside a small, high-speed aircraft or a powerful fan.\nThe video exhibits significant digital corruption, appearing as a rapidly shifting mosaic of horizontal video strips, while the audio features a piercing, high-speed mechanical whir layered over powerful, low-frequency rumbling and rushing air sounds.\n\nThe video displays significant digital corruption, appearing as rapidly shifting horizontal strips, accompanied by a piercing high-speed mechanical whir layered over intense low-frequency rumbling and rushing air sounds.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays significant digital corruption, appearing as rapidly shifting horizontal strips, accompanied by a piercing high-speed mechanical whir layered over intense low-frequency rumbling and rushing air sounds.}}", "time_sec": 305.236, "generation_time_seconds": 219.6289, "selection_time_seconds": 83.7269, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 3.28, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "148", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man speaks on a pier next to a body of water as waves splash in the background.", "pred": "A fragmented, pixelated mosaic of a seascape and a dark vertical pier structure is accompanied by a male voice stating \"standing on the edge of the dock,\" followed by the sound of waves lapping against a hard surface.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A fragmented, pixelated mosaic of a seascape and a dark vertical pier structure is accompanied by a male voice stating \"standing on the edge of the dock,\" followed by the sound of waves lapping against a hard surface.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream consists of a heavily fragmented, pixelated, and mosaic-like composite of different scenes, including a light blue sky with clouds, a body of water, and dark vertical structures resembling a pier or dock. Concurrently, the audio features a male voice stating, \"standing on the edge of the dock,\" immediately followed by the sound of waves lapping against a hard surface.\nThe visual is an abstract, glitch-art mosaic of a seascape and a dock. The audio contains a male voice mentioning being on a dock, followed by the sound of water lapping.\nThe visual is a fragmented, pixelated mosaic of a seascape and a dark, vertical structure resembling a dock. The audio contains a male voice stating \"standing on the edge of the dock,\" immediately followed by the sound of waves lapping against a hard surface.\n\nA fragmented, pixelated mosaic of a seascape and a dark vertical pier structure is accompanied by a male voice stating \"standing on the edge of the dock,\" followed by the sound of waves lapping against a hard surface.", "time_sec": 272.551, "generation_time_seconds": 186.9261, "selection_time_seconds": 83.4427, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "149", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the man's voice blends with the sound of ocean waves trickling and splashing, the bow of a sailboat navigates through the open sea with the wind and waves.", "pred": "A horizontally corrupted image of a bright, reflective water surface under a cloudy sky is accompanied by a male voice speaking over prominent wind noise.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A horizontally corrupted image of a bright, reflective water surface under a cloudy sky is accompanied by a male voice speaking over prominent wind noise.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual field is a heavily distorted, horizontal-stripe composite of a bright sky and a dark, reflective body of water, suggesting a glitched view of a coastal or maritime environment.\nThe audio consists of prominent, rushing wind noise and a male voice speaking conversationally.\nThe visual data is a corrupted, horizontally-sliced image of a bright, possibly water-sky scene, while the audio contains a male speaker's voice layered over loud, constant wind noise, suggesting an outdoor recording with significant environmental interference.\n\nA horizontally corrupted image of a bright, reflective water surface under a cloudy sky is accompanied by a male voice speaking over prominent wind noise.", "time_sec": 223.581, "generation_time_seconds": 137.8613, "selection_time_seconds": 83.4909, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "150", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bathroom with a white urinal and a black drain, a man's voice is muffled by the camera as water gurgles in the drain, followed by the sound of a toilet flushing.", "pred": "A toilet flushes and refills audibly, while the visual shows severe digital corruption with green, black, and white horizontal static bars.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A toilet flushes and refills audibly, while the visual shows severe digital corruption with green, black, and white horizontal static bars.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio captures the distinct, powerful sound of a toilet tank refilling with water, followed by the loud, cascading flush, while the accompanying visual is a low-resolution, abstract, and glitchy pattern of green, black, and white horizontal bars.\nThe audio clearly documents the sequence of a toilet's flush cycle, beginning with the tank refilling and culminating in the forceful flush. Concurrently, the visual data is a distorted, fragmented image composed of horizontal bands, exhibiting severe digital corruption or compression artifacts, with no discernible real-world objects.\nThe audio is a clear, close-miked recording of a toilet's operation, including the mechanical sound of the tank filling with water and the subsequent, powerful, gurgling flush. The visual is a heavily corrupted image, characterized by horizontal banding, pixelation, and color artifacts, resembling a video buffer error or a glitch effect, with no identifiable scene or object.\n\nA toilet flushes and refills audibly, while the visual shows severe digital corruption with green, black, and white horizontal static bars.", "time_sec": 274.722, "generation_time_seconds": 189.1226, "selection_time_seconds": 83.3106, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.35, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "151", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bustling city, a man in a suit and tie walks down a train as a woman gazes out the window, while a group of people chat amidst the sound of a crying infant and a muffled bus engine.", "pred": "A severely corrupted video frame with horizontal digital tearing and color distortion is accompanied by the continuous, high-pitched distressed bleating of what sounds like a young goat or lamb, layered over unidentifiable human background chatter.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A severely corrupted video frame with horizontal digital tearing and color distortion is accompanied by the continuous, high-pitched distressed bleating of what sounds like a young goat or lamb, layered over unidentifiable human background chatter.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is completely corrupted, displaying severe digital artifacts including horizontal tearing, color banding, and mosaic-like block distortion across the entire frame.\nThe audio features a prominent, high-pitched, distressed cry, likely from a small animal such as a goat or lamb, layered over a background of indistinct human speech.\nThe cry is continuous and consistent throughout the clip, suggesting the animal is in a state of distress or pain.\nThe human speech is muffled and unintelligible, with the phrase \"been sent out a long time ago\" being partially discernible.\nThe overall soundscape suggests an outdoor or rural setting, possibly a farm.\nThe visual and audio streams appear to be from the same event but are not synchronized.\nThe final answer must be a single sentence that is\nA severely corrupted video frame with horizontal digital tearing and color distortion is accompanied by the continuous, high-pitched distressed bleating of what sounds like a young goat or lamb, layered over unidentifiable human background chatter.\n\nA severely corrupted video frame with horizontal digital tearing and color distortion is accompanied by the continuous, high-pitched distressed bleating of what sounds like a young goat or lamb, layered over unidentifiable human background chatter.", "time_sec": 291.199, "generation_time_seconds": 206.0771, "selection_time_seconds": 82.8055, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "152", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of metal clacking sharply as water drains down a pipe is accompanied by the visual of a white urinal with a red hole in the drain.", "pred": "A blurry, greenish-yellow image is accompanied by a rapid series of metallic clanks followed by a sustained electronic buzzer.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A blurry, greenish-yellow image is accompanied by a rapid series of metallic clanks followed by a sustained electronic buzzer.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image is extremely blurry and pixelated, making it impossible to discern any specific objects or details; the audio consists of a rhythmic, metallic clanking sound followed by a loud, sustained, low-pitched electronic buzzer.\nThe visual field is a completely obscured, low-resolution blur of indistinct, horizontal bands of muted greenish-yellow. The accompanying audio is dominated by a repetitive, sharp metallic impact, immediately succeeded by a harsh, continuous electronic tone.\nThe audio begins with a rapid, rhythmic series of sharp, high-frequency metallic impacts, each with a short, bright decay. This sequence is abruptly followed by a single, sustained, low-pitched electronic buzzer that continues without interruption until the end of the clip.\n\nA blurry, greenish-yellow image is accompanied by a rapid series of metallic clanks followed by a sustained electronic buzzer.", "time_sec": 268.962, "generation_time_seconds": 183.381, "selection_time_seconds": 83.6711, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "153", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The engine vibrates as a man speaks while looking under the hood at the exposed engine of a car.", "pred": "A loud mechanical whine stops abruptly, immediately followed by the sound of a heavy object being dropped.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A loud mechanical whine stops abruptly, immediately followed by the sound of a heavy object being dropped.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual field is a completely abstract, fragmented, and distorted mosaic of dark, metallic-looking textures and geometric patterns, possibly resembling a close-up of computer hardware or a digital glitch effect. The audio consists of a loud, sustained, high-pitched mechanical whine that abruptly cuts off, followed by the sound of a heavy object being dropped onto a hard surface.\nThe audio features a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine that stops suddenly, immediately followed by the sound of a heavy object being dropped onto a hard floor.\nThe sound begins with a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine, suggesting the operation of a powerful motor or machine. This sound is sustained for a few seconds before stopping abruptly. Immediately after the whine ends, there is a distinct, sharp sound of a heavy, hard object being dropped and landing on a hard surface.\n\nA loud mechanical whine stops abruptly, immediately followed by the sound of a heavy object being dropped.", "time_sec": 282.909, "generation_time_seconds": 196.5036, "selection_time_seconds": 84.0797, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "154", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio whooshes as a woman speaks, followed by digital beeps and men talking, while a person stands on a boat in the ocean next to a logo for a technology company.", "pred": "A severely corrupted video image of abstract green pixels overlays a sequence of audio including a synthesized voice stating \"BB talking intercom connected,\" male speech, and a final sustained electronic buzz.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A severely corrupted video image of abstract green pixels overlays a sequence of audio including a synthesized voice stating \"BB talking intercom connected,\" male speech, and a final sustained electronic buzz.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThis is a highly corrupted video stream, displaying severe horizontal and vertical block artifacts that scramble a static, pixelated image of a green-tinted, abstract scene, likely from a retro video game, while the audio consists of a synthesized voice announcing \"BB talking intercom connected\" followed by male speech.\nThe video displays extreme digital corruption, with large horizontal bands and vertical blockiness obscuring any clear scene, resulting in a static, abstract image of green and black pixels suggestive of a low-resolution, retro video game environment.\nThe audio consists of a synthesized voice saying \"BB talking intercom connected,\" followed by male speech and concluding with a loud, sustained electronic buzz.\n\nA severely corrupted video image of abstract green pixels overlays a sequence of audio including a synthesized voice stating \"BB talking intercom connected,\" male speech, and a final sustained electronic buzz.", "time_sec": 251.678, "generation_time_seconds": 165.8488, "selection_time_seconds": 83.5144, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.76, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "155", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man with a tattoo on his arm stirs a pan of sizzling green peppers and onions on the stove, creating a symphony of banging and cracking sounds.", "pred": "A man discusses seasoning vegetables with black pepper, accompanied by the rattling sound of a spice jar being shaken and a subsequent sharp clack.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A man discusses seasoning vegetables with black pepper, accompanied by the rattling sound of a spice jar being shaken and a subsequent sharp clack.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a male speaker discussing cooking, specifically the need to season vegetables and the use of black pepper, accompanied by the rattling sound of a spice container and a sharp clack.\nA man discusses seasoning vegetables with black pepper, accompanied by the sound of a spice jar being shaken and a sharp clack.\nThe audio states a need to season vegetables and explicitly mentions black pepper, which is corroborated by the distinct rattling sound of a spice jar being shaken. This is immediately followed by a sharp, percussive clack, likely the sound of the jar being placed down or a lid being closed.\n\nA man discusses seasoning vegetables with black pepper, accompanied by the rattling sound of a spice jar being shaken and a subsequent sharp clack.", "time_sec": 258.614, "generation_time_seconds": 172.3614, "selection_time_seconds": 83.9471, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.25, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "156", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man's voice echoes as race cars speed and the engine humming sound through turns on the track.", "pred": "A distorted, pixelated mosaic of brown and beige textures is paired with the aggressive roar of a powerful engine and high-pitched tire squeal.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A distorted, pixelated mosaic of brown and beige textures is paired with the aggressive roar of a powerful engine and high-pitched tire squeal.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated mosaic of brown and beige textures, resembling a close-up of woven fabric or a similar material, with no discernible coherent scene or object.\nThe audio consists of a powerful, low-frequency engine sound, likely from a large motorcycle or custom car, accelerating aggressively with a deep, throaty roar, accompanied by the high-pitched tire squeal of rapid acceleration or a burnout.\nThe audio is a loud, low-frequency engine roar with a high-pitched tire squeal, indicating rapid acceleration or a burnout, while the visual is an abstract, glitched pattern of brown and beige squares, resembling a degraded close-up of a textured surface.\n\nA distorted, pixelated mosaic of brown and beige textures is paired with the aggressive roar of a powerful engine and high-pitched tire squeal.", "time_sec": 311.953, "generation_time_seconds": 225.4129, "selection_time_seconds": 84.4172, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "157", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man laughing while making a cloud of smoke on a table, as a man on a surfboard in a pool of water bottle with a table and chairs on the floor talks.", "pred": "A loud crash and a man laughing and saying \"Okay\" are heard over a severely corrupted, pixelated, and scrambled video image.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A loud crash and a man laughing and saying \"Okay\" are heard over a severely corrupted, pixelated, and scrambled video image.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe digital corruption, showing a distorted, pixelated, and horizontally scrambled image with unclear, shifting rectangular blocks of color.\nThis visual corruption is accompanied by the sound of a loud, sudden crash, followed by a person audibly laughing and then speaking the word \"Okay.\".\nThe visual data is completely non-representational, consisting of a scrambled and corrupted video stream with no discernible objects or scenes.\nThe audio track is clear and contains a sequence of distinct, non-overlapping events: a loud, sharp crash, the sound of a person laughing, and a male voice saying \"Okay.\"\nThe physical properties of the video and audio are independent; the chaotic visuals do not correspond to the events in the audio.\nThe final answer must be a single sentence that objectively combines these two separate streams of sensory information.\nThe audio reveals a loud crash followed by a man laughing and saying \"Okay,\" while the video is a severely corrupted, pixelated, and scrambled image with no discernible content.\n\nA loud crash and a man laughing and saying \"Okay\" are heard over a severely corrupted, pixelated, and scrambled video image.", "time_sec": 266.332, "generation_time_seconds": 181.1217, "selection_time_seconds": 83.3682, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "158", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a white tiled room, a small motor buzzes as a man speaks while a metal door closes, resembling a microwave oven.", "pred": "\\boxed{A male voice speaks over a low hum while severe digital distortion creates horizontal bands of fragmented, blurred color and texture across the screen.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A male voice speaks over a low hum while severe digital distortion creates horizontal bands of fragmented, blurred color and texture across the screen.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe digital distortion, with horizontal bands of scrambled, fragmented, and overlapping visual data in shades of blue, yellow, and black, while a male voice speaks in the foreground.\nThe visual stream consists of persistent horizontal banding and pixelation, causing the display to flicker between abstract, low-resolution patterns of light and dark stripes, interspersed with brief flashes of what appears to be corrupted text, all set against a pale, static background.\nThe audio features a male voice speaking, with the words \"it works actually\" clearly audible, while a continuous, low-frequency humming sound, like that of a machine, is present in the background.\n\n\\boxed{A male voice speaks over a low hum while severe digital distortion creates horizontal bands of fragmented, blurred color and texture across the screen.}", "time_sec": 237.245, "generation_time_seconds": 151.8537, "selection_time_seconds": 83.1169, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.06, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "159", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a building, a man stands in front of a large TV as a crowd of people laughs, applause, and claps in response to his speech.", "pred": "A male voice speaks in Hindi before an audience laughs and claps, while the visual displays a chaotic, rapidly shifting mosaic of fragmented, colorful rectangles.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A male voice speaks in Hindi before an audience laughs and claps, while the visual displays a chaotic, rapidly shifting mosaic of fragmented, colorful rectangles.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains a male voice speaking in Hindi, followed by a large crowd's loud laughter and applause. Simultaneously, the visual is an abstract, rapidly changing mosaic of fragmented, colorful, and distorted rectangular shapes, resembling a glitching or corrupted video display.\nA male voice speaks in Hindi, immediately followed by a loud, sustained wave of audience laughter and applause, while the visual displays a chaotic, rapidly-shifting mosaic of fragmented and distorted colored rectangles.\nThe audio and visual streams are completely distinct. The audio captures a live, public event with a speaker and an audience, while the visual is a non-representational, abstract pattern of moving rectangles, suggesting a digital glitch or intentional visual effect.\n\nA male voice speaks in Hindi before an audience laughs and claps, while the visual displays a chaotic, rapidly shifting mosaic of fragmented, colorful rectangles.", "time_sec": 286.553, "generation_time_seconds": 200.3817, "selection_time_seconds": 84.152, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "160", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The little girl is peacefully sleeping on the couch , while the sound of snoring fills the room.", "pred": "The video displays a heavily corrupted, pixelated image of a dark, indistinct scene, while the audio features a prominent, rhythmic, deep snoring sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "The video displays a heavily corrupted, pixelated image of a dark, indistinct scene, while the audio features a prominent, rhythmic, deep snoring sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is heavily distorted with horizontal banding and pixelation, obscuring any clear subject or environment. Concurrently, the audio consists of loud, rhythmic, low-pitched snoring, indicating the presence of a sleeping person.\nThe video frame is severely corrupted with horizontal static and blocky artifacts, rendering the visual scene unrecognizable. Auditory analysis reveals a distinct, cyclical pattern of loud, low-frequency snoring sounds, indicating a person is sleeping nearby.\nThe visual data is composed of a mosaic of dark, horizontal, interlaced bands, exhibiting significant pixelation and digital corruption that prevents the identification of any objects or environment. Simultaneously, the audio track is dominated by a recurring, deep, guttural snoring sound, which is rhythmic and consistent in tempo and volume.\n\nThe video displays a heavily corrupted, pixelated image of a dark, indistinct scene, while the audio features a prominent, rhythmic, deep snoring sound.", "time_sec": 259.744, "generation_time_seconds": 173.4638, "selection_time_seconds": 84.2019, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "161", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The  woman stood in front of the black and white mural, surrounded by paintings of skulls, skeletons, and a fox, as they heard the sound of spraying and hissing with light vibrations..", "pred": "A heavily pixelated, glitched image of horizontal, indistinct color bands is paired with the loud, high-pitched whirring and cutting sound of a power saw.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated, glitched image of horizontal, indistinct color bands is paired with the loud, high-pitched whirring and cutting sound of a power saw.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains only the sound of a power tool, specifically a saw, in operation, with no discernible speech or music.\nThe provided image is a heavily distorted, pixelated, and fragmented visual, composed of horizontal bands of various colors including black, white, grey, orange, and blue, with no discernible coherent objects or scenes.\nThe audio exclusively features the high-pitched, abrasive whirring and cutting sound of a power saw.\nThe visual is a fragmented, glitched image, appearing as a mosaic of horizontal bars with distorted, indistinct shapes.\nNo coherent scene or object can be identified from the visual, and no other sounds are present in the audio.\n\nA heavily pixelated, glitched image of horizontal, indistinct color bands is paired with the loud, high-pitched whirring and cutting sound of a power saw.", "time_sec": 260.9, "generation_time_seconds": 175.3745, "selection_time_seconds": 83.5968, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "162", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The rhythmic tick-tock of a large clock with visible gears accompanies a man hanging a black and white clock on the wall in his house.", "pred": "The video displays horizontal digital distortion while sharp mechanical clicks sound intermittently.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "The video displays horizontal digital distortion while sharp mechanical clicks sound intermittently.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays significant horizontal digital distortion, creating fragmented, wavy bands of brown and black.\nThe audio consists of a series of distinct, sharp mechanical clicks, resembling the operation of a manual typewriter or a camera shutter, occurring at irregular intervals.\nThe composite audiovisual data depicts a scene of technological malfunction, characterized by persistent digital video corruption and the intermittent, percussive sounds of a mechanical device operating in a silent environment.\n\nThe video displays horizontal digital distortion while sharp mechanical clicks sound intermittently.", "time_sec": 261.961, "generation_time_seconds": 175.4795, "selection_time_seconds": 84.2486, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "163", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a man in a cap looks at the camera and makes a funny face and  speaking ,whistling sound.", "pred": "A person speaks, followed by a series of high-pitched, rapid, and repetitive squeaking sounds, while the visual field is obscured by severe horizontal banding and pixelation.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A person speaks, followed by a series of high-pitched, rapid, and repetitive squeaking sounds, while the visual field is obscured by severe horizontal banding and pixelation.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene is visually degraded, displaying significant digital compression artifacts with horizontal black and white bands and pixelated blocks obscuring any clear subject or environment.\nThe audio consists of a person speaking, immediately followed by a series of high-pitched, rapid, and repetitive squeaking sounds.\nA person speaks, followed by a series of high-pitched, rapid, and repetitive squeaking sounds, while the visual field is obscured by severe horizontal banding and pixelation.\n\nA person speaks, followed by a series of high-pitched, rapid, and repetitive squeaking sounds, while the visual field is obscured by severe horizontal banding and pixelation.", "time_sec": 249.05, "generation_time_seconds": 162.9914, "selection_time_seconds": 84.1096, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "164", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the man talks, a swarm of insects buzz around him.", "pred": "A man speaks in Russian, saying \"We failed, we're on,\" over background birdsong, while a blue title screen reads \"Operation Zero Hornet\" and static appears on the screen.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A man speaks in Russian, saying \"We failed, we're on,\" over background birdsong, while a blue title screen reads \"Operation Zero Hornet\" and static appears on the screen.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man speaks in Russian while faint birds chirp in the background.\nA blue screen with horizontal static bars is visible, and the audio contains a male voice speaking in Russian accompanied by background birdsong.\nA male voice speaks in Russian, stating \"Провалили, включились\" (\"We failed, we're on\"), while faint, high-pitched birds chirp in the background.\n\nA man speaks in Russian, saying \"We failed, we're on,\" over background birdsong, while a blue title screen reads \"Operation Zero Hornet\" and static appears on the screen.", "time_sec": 258.801, "generation_time_seconds": 173.6303, "selection_time_seconds": 83.0862, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "165", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of knocking followed by a machine sawing accompanies a man using a saw to cut a wooden board on a work bench.", "pred": "A mechanical click initiates a high-pitched whirring layered over a low hum, heard over a severely corrupted video feed of static, blocky pixels, and horizontal/vertical lines.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A mechanical click initiates a high-pitched whirring layered over a low hum, heard over a severely corrupted video feed of static, blocky pixels, and horizontal/vertical lines.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio begins with a sharp mechanical click, immediately followed by a continuous, high-pitched, abrasive whirring sound consistent with a small electric motor or rotating tool.\n This is layered over a persistent, low-frequency electronic hum.\n Simultaneously, the visual field is dominated by severe digital corruption, characterized by static, horizontal and vertical line artifacts, and blocky, discolored pixelated areas, obscuring any clear scene or subject.\nThe audio presents a mechanical click followed by a high-pitched, abrasive whirring sound layered over a low-frequency hum, while the visual is a static, blocky, and pixelated display with horizontal and vertical line artifacts, indicating a corrupted video signal.\nThe audio's mechanical and electronic sounds suggest a device is being activated in a quiet environment, while the visual data shows a corrupted signal with no discernible content.\n\nA mechanical click initiates a high-pitched whirring layered over a low hum, heard over a severely corrupted video feed of static, blocky pixels, and horizontal/vertical lines.", "time_sec": 323.205, "generation_time_seconds": 236.5864, "selection_time_seconds": 83.4007, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "166", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the kitchen, a woman fries food while talking, standing next to a white refrigerator.", "pred": "A heavily distorted, pixelated image of a kitchen scene is accompanied by the sound of food sizzling in a pan and a person talking.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted, pixelated image of a kitchen scene is accompanied by the sound of food sizzling in a pan and a person talking.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image is a heavily distorted, pixelated mosaic composed of horizontal bands in shades of brown, tan, and orange, with fragmented, unreadable patterns and text visible within the blocks.\nThe audio contains the distinct, continuous sound of sizzling and frying food in a hot pan.\nThe audio stream contains the sound of sizzling and frying food, suggesting a cooking activity, which is visually represented by a distorted, pixelated image composed of horizontal bands of brown and tan hues.\n\nA heavily distorted, pixelated image of a kitchen scene is accompanied by the sound of food sizzling in a pan and a person talking.", "time_sec": 264.041, "generation_time_seconds": 178.8572, "selection_time_seconds": 83.1341, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.27, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "167", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man speaks as a stream of water trickles in the background, while a young man rides a boat with a camera on board.", "pred": "A fragmented, abstract visual mosaic of green and grey tiles is paired with audio describing a \"5 horsepower four-stroke outboard motor\" in an ambient environment.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A fragmented, abstract visual mosaic of green and grey tiles is paired with audio describing a \"5 horsepower four-stroke outboard motor\" in an ambient environment.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe provided image is a mosaic of fragmented, distorted, and overlapping visual tiles, showing no discernible coherent scene, characters, or environment, while the audio contains a person describing a \"5 horsepower four-stroke outboard motor\" in a setting with ambient background noise.\nThe audio identifies a \"5 horsepower four-stroke outboard motor\" being described in an environment with ambient sounds, while the visual consists solely of a fragmented, distorted, and abstract mosaic of green and grey tiles, showing no clear scene or subject.\nThe audio identifies a \"5 horsepower four-stroke outboard motor\" being described in an environment with ambient sounds, while the visual consists solely of a fragmented, distorted, and abstract mosaic of green and grey tiles, showing no clear scene or subject.\n\nA fragmented, abstract visual mosaic of green and grey tiles is paired with audio describing a \"5 horsepower four-stroke outboard motor\" in an ambient environment.", "time_sec": 255.825, "generation_time_seconds": 170.0036, "selection_time_seconds": 83.5638, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "168", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of rushing water fills the room, as a  wooden shelf surrounded by books and a clock on the wall.", "pred": "A severely corrupted video displays fragmented horizontal color bands, while the audio exclusively contains the sound of splashing water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A severely corrupted video displays fragmented horizontal color bands, while the audio exclusively contains the sound of splashing water.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is heavily distorted, showing fragmented and glitched horizontal lines of yellow, brown, and black, with no discernible subject or scene. Simultaneously, the audio consists exclusively of the continuous, complex sound of splashing and flowing water, with no other ambient or contextual noises present.\nThe video frame presents a severe digital corruption, characterized by horizontal bands of static, blocky artifacts, and shifting color patterns, making it impossible to identify any coherent visual content. Concurrently, the audio track is dominated by the clear, continuous sound of splashing and flowing water, suggesting an active water source such as a fountain or a strong stream, but lacking any other environmental cues.\nThe visual information is entirely abstract due to extreme digital corruption, manifesting as rapidly shifting horizontal bars of color and static. The audio provides a singular, high-fidelity recording of splashing water, indicating a physical water feature. There is no visual element that corresponds to the source of the water sound, nor is there any other ambient noise to suggest a shared environment or context.\n\nA severely corrupted video displays fragmented horizontal color bands, while the audio exclusively contains the sound of splashing water.", "time_sec": 312.76, "generation_time_seconds": 227.9564, "selection_time_seconds": 82.8145, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "169", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The car engine idles before revving loudly, as a young woman with blue hair stands next to a man with a dog on his head.", "pred": "A car engine is started and revved, producing a low hum followed by a sharp increase in pitch.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A car engine is started and revved, producing a low hum followed by a sharp increase in pitch.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio captures the sound of a car engine being started and revved.\nThe audio exclusively features the sound of a car engine, including the initial cranking noise and the subsequent revving of the engine.\nThe audio is dominated by the low-frequency hum of a car engine idling, followed by the distinct sound of the engine being revved, causing its pitch to rise sharply.\n\nA car engine is started and revved, producing a low hum followed by a sharp increase in pitch.", "time_sec": 237.822, "generation_time_seconds": 151.9833, "selection_time_seconds": 83.8115, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "170", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A man speaks over an intercom as a muffled helicopter engine roars, followed by gunshots firing in a video game displayed on a laptop screen.", "pred": "A low-resolution, glitched first-person video game view shows a dark cockpit interior with multiple HUD displays, synchronized with a radio transmission announcing \"objective alpha has just been neutralized.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A low-resolution, glitched first-person video game view shows a dark cockpit interior with multiple HUD displays, synchronized with a radio transmission announcing \"objective alpha has just been neutralized.\"", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image is a heavily distorted, fragmented screen capture from a video game, showing a first-person view of a digital environment with overlaid text and graphics, accompanied by a radio communication reporting an enemy \"neutralized.\"\nThe scene is a first-person video game interface with distorted, glitched visuals and digital HUD elements, synchronized with a radio transmission announcing \"objective alpha has just been neutralized.\"\nThe primary visual is a heavily corrupted, fragmented first-person perspective from a video game, featuring a dark environment, a heads-up display with text and meters, and a prominent, non-English name on a menu. This is synchronized with an audio track containing a male voice speaking English over radio static, reporting on a mission objective.\n\nA low-resolution, glitched first-person video game view shows a dark cockpit interior with multiple HUD displays, synchronized with a radio transmission announcing \"objective alpha has just been neutralized.\"", "time_sec": 273.649, "generation_time_seconds": 187.2979, "selection_time_seconds": 83.7857, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.53, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "171", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man wearing a blue glove washes dishes in a kitchen sink with running water as he talks to an elderly woman, accompanied by the sound of plastic clacks and water running down a drain.", "pred": "A person wearing a blue glove sprays a yellow liquid from a hose into a sink while a male voice states, \"Well, I was spraying all over something,\" immediately followed by a loud hissing sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A person wearing a blue glove sprays a yellow liquid from a hose into a sink while a male voice states, \"Well, I was spraying all over something,\" immediately followed by a loud hissing sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image is a digital mosaic composed of many small, rectangular tiles depicting abstract, distorted, and fragmented scenes of an indoor environment with visible blinds and light patterns.\nThe audio features a male voice stating, \"Well, I was spraying all over something,\" immediately before a loud, sustained hissing sound, resembling a pressurized spray can being used.\nThe audio confirms the visual of blinds by describing a spraying action, which is accompanied by a loud hissing sound consistent with a spray can.\n\\boxed{}\n\nA person wearing a blue glove sprays a yellow liquid from a hose into a sink while a male voice states, \"Well, I was spraying all over something,\" immediately followed by a loud hissing sound.", "time_sec": 245.655, "generation_time_seconds": 159.7662, "selection_time_seconds": 83.5977, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.28, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "172", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The microwave oven hums loudly as an adult male and a child chat, while a sudden beep interrupts the conversation, with a TV playing in the background.", "pred": "A severely glitched video of abstract, shifting bars accompanies a man describing mechanical \"cranking noises\" and stating he has \"taken the parts out,\" followed by a woman saying \"Hi.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A severely glitched video of abstract, shifting bars accompanies a man describing mechanical \"cranking noises\" and stating he has \"taken the parts out,\" followed by a woman saying \"Hi.\"", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is a highly corrupted, glitched image composed of rapidly shifting horizontal bars displaying fragmented, abstract geometric patterns in various colors and textures.\n The audio consists of a series of distinct mechanical sounds, beginning with a low, rhythmic cranking noise, which is then joined by a rapid, high-pitched staccato clicking, as a male voice states, \"cranking noises,\" followed by a female voice saying, \"Hi,\" and the male voice adding, \"cranky. See, you know, I've taken the parts out.\"\n The combination of severe digital visual corruption and layered mechanical and human sounds suggests a recording of a\nThe video shows a severe digital glitch with horizontal blocks of distorted, abstract patterns, while the audio contains a male voice describing mechanical cranking and clicking noises, interspersed with a female voice saying \"Hi,\" and the male voice stating that he has \"taken the parts out.\"\nThe visual stream is a severe digital corruption, displaying rapidly shifting horizontal bands of abstract, fragmented patterns in dark, metallic, and earthy textures, obscuring any discernible subject or environment.\n The audio features a male voice clearly stating, \"cranking noises\" and later, \"cranky. See, you know, I've taken the parts out,\" accompanied by hissing and clicking mechanical sounds, and a brief \"Hi\" from a female voice.\n By analyzing the audio and visual streams independently, the scene is objectively a recording of a malfunctioning device, with a corrupted video feed and an operator describing the sounds of its mechanical failure and\n\nA severely glitched video of abstract, shifting bars accompanies a man describing mechanical \"cranking noises\" and stating he has \"taken the parts out,\" followed by a woman saying \"Hi.\"", "time_sec": 330.774, "generation_time_seconds": 245.8477, "selection_time_seconds": 83.16, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "173", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The cordless drill with a battery in it is being used to work on something, creating vibrations and humming as it starts and stops several times.", "pred": "A digital glitch effect with fragmented horizontal bands of orange, teal, and black overlays a close-up of a teal power drill, while the audio captures the sharp, repeated metallic snaps of a staple gun being fired in an enclosed space.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A digital glitch effect with fragmented horizontal bands of orange, teal, and black overlays a close-up of a teal power drill, while the audio captures the sharp, repeated metallic snaps of a staple gun being fired in an enclosed space.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a glitch effect with distorted horizontal bands of orange, teal, and black, while the audio features the distinct sound of a staple gun being used repeatedly.\nThe visual stream consists of fragmented, horizontally stacked rectangular segments exhibiting severe digital distortion, with color blocks of orange, teal, and black shifting and flashing across the frame in a non-linear sequence. Simultaneously, the audio captures the sharp, rapid mechanical sounds of a staple gun being operated repeatedly, each punctuated by a metallic snapping noise, with a faint underlying hum present in the background.\nThe visual stream displays a digital glitch effect characterized by horizontal bands of orange, teal, black, and white that are fragmented, misaligned, and shifting in a non-linear, abstract pattern. Concurrently, the audio features the distinct, rapid mechanical sounds of a staple gun being operated repeatedly, each trigger pull producing a sharp metallic snap followed by a brief hiss of compressed air, consistent with a pneumatic tool in use within an enclosed space.\n\nA digital glitch effect with fragmented horizontal bands of orange, teal, and black overlays a close-up of a teal power drill, while the audio captures the sharp, repeated metallic snaps of a staple gun being fired in an enclosed space.", "time_sec": 307.01, "generation_time_seconds": 221.6098, "selection_time_seconds": 82.9802, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "174", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a serene farm setting, a man's voice is heard speaking as goats and a cow make their sounds, while a little white lamb  stand near a wooden fence in the grass.", "pred": "A human male speaks in Japanese, immediately followed by the bleating sound of a goat.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A human male speaks in Japanese, immediately followed by the bleating sound of a goat.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe speaker's voice is heard, followed by the sound of a goat bleating.\nA human male speaking in Japanese is heard, immediately followed by the distinct bleating sound of a goat.\nA human male speaks in Japanese, immediately followed by the bleating sound of a goat.\n\nA human male speaks in Japanese, immediately followed by the bleating sound of a goat.", "time_sec": 243.144, "generation_time_seconds": 157.3038, "selection_time_seconds": 83.0193, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "175", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a city parking lot, several fire trucks are parked next to a building as men speak in the distance while whistling and humming.", "pred": "A heavy vehicle's squealing brakes and hiss are heard over a heavily distorted visual mosaic of buildings, greenery, and red-and-white vehicles.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavy vehicle's squealing brakes and hiss are heard over a heavily distorted visual mosaic of buildings, greenery, and red-and-white vehicles.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is a heavily distorted, pixelated mosaic of various scenes, including what appears to be a modern building, greenery, and multiple red and white vehicles, all rendered in a glitchy, fragmented style.\n The audio stream is dominated by the loud, continuous rumble and squeal of a large vehicle, specifically a bus, with the distinct hiss of air brakes being released.\n Combining these observations, the sound of the bus is the most prominent and clear audio event, while the visual information is fragmented and abstract, making it impossible to definitively link the auditory event to a specific visual element.\nThe audio identifies a large vehicle, likely a bus, with the prominent hiss of air brakes, while the visual is an abstract, glitched mosaic of urban and red-and-white vehicle imagery, with no clear, synchronized scene to correlate the sound with.\nThe audio is dominated by the loud, continuous rumbling and screeching of a large vehicle, consistent with a bus, accompanied by the sharp hiss of air brakes being applied.\n The visual is a fragmented and distorted mosaic, composed of numerous small, shifting tiles showing abstracted scenes of modern architecture, green foliage, and multiple red-and-white vehicles, rendered with heavy digital glitch and pixelation effects.\n The two modalities are temporally aligned but semantically disconnected; the specific visual elements cannot be definitively linked to the auditory event of the bus, as the visuals are abstract, non-narrative, and lack a clear spatial or\n\nA heavy vehicle's squealing brakes and hiss are heard over a heavily distorted visual mosaic of buildings, greenery, and red-and-white vehicles.", "time_sec": 354.175, "generation_time_seconds": 269.3139, "selection_time_seconds": 82.6369, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "176", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The church bells ring amidst audio static as a man stands under a wooden roof in the attic.", "pred": "A heavily distorted, abstract, and pixelated composite of dark, blurred shapes is paired with the loud, rhythmic, low-pitched pulse of a large bell.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted, abstract, and pixelated composite of dark, blurred shapes is paired with the loud, rhythmic, low-pitched pulse of a large bell.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, pixelated, and horizontally blurred composite of abstract shapes and colors, dominated by dark grays, blacks, and streaks of brown and orange, with no discernible objects or figures. Simultaneously, a loud, low-pitched, sustained chord from a large bell or gong is heard, featuring a clear, repeating rhythmic pulse.\nThe visual depicts a heavily distorted, pixelated, and horizontally blurred pattern of abstract, indistinct shapes and colors, primarily dark grays, blacks, and streaks of brown and orange, with no clear subjects. Concurrently, the audio features a loud, low-pitched, sustained chord from a large bell or gong, marked by a clear, repeating rhythmic pulse.\nThe image is a mosaic of highly abstract, horizontally elongated, and blurred shapes in dark grays, blacks, and muted browns/oranges, showing no clear subjects or context. The audio consists of a loud, low-pitched, sustained chord from a large bell or gong, which is pulsed rhythmically at a slow tempo.\n\nA heavily distorted, abstract, and pixelated composite of dark, blurred shapes is paired with the loud, rhythmic, low-pitched pulse of a large bell.", "time_sec": 293.685, "generation_time_seconds": 207.4253, "selection_time_seconds": 84.2145, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "177", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a cozy bedroom, a man talks while a person snores, and one man take a video.", "pred": "\\boxed{The video displays abstract, horizontally-striped blocks of red and brown color, while the audio contains a man speaking the word \"meth\" followed by a loud gagging sound.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{The video displays abstract, horizontally-striped blocks of red and brown color, while the audio contains a man speaking the word \"meth\" followed by a loud gagging sound.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream consists entirely of abstract, horizontally-striped, and pixelated blocks of color, primarily red, orange, and dark brown, with no discernible objects or figures. Simultaneously, the audio features a person speaking the word \"meth\", followed by a loud, wet, and guttural gagging or retching sound that continues for several seconds.\nThe sequence of abstract horizontal bars is composed of blurry, reddish-orange and dark brown textures, with no clear forms, while the audio contains a spoken word \"meth\" followed by a prolonged, wet, and forceful gagging sound.\nThe visual scene is composed of abstract, horizontally-oriented rectangular blocks of color, predominantly in shades of red, orange, and dark brown, with a motion-blurred texture suggesting rapid movement, but no identifiable objects, people, or environments. Concurrently, the audio stream begins with a male voice clearly enunciating the word \"meth,\" which is immediately followed by a loud, wet, and guttural gagging or retching sound that persists for several seconds.\n\n\\boxed{The video displays abstract, horizontally-striped blocks of red and brown color, while the audio contains a man speaking the word \"meth\" followed by a loud gagging sound.}", "time_sec": 273.656, "generation_time_seconds": 189.0728, "selection_time_seconds": 82.6929, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "178", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red truck with its lights on driving down a dark street at dusk, accompanied by the wailing police sirens and the sound of heavy wind blowing into a microphone.", "pred": "A severe digital video glitch displays fragmented horizontal bands of light and dark pixels, accompanied by the loud, modulating wail of a siren layered over a continuous rushing wind sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A severe digital video glitch displays fragmented horizontal bands of light and dark pixels, accompanied by the loud, modulating wail of a siren layered over a continuous rushing wind sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a severe digital glitch effect, with the image fragmented into horizontal, shifting, and rapidly changing rectangular blocks of color, primarily red and dark hues. Simultaneously, the audio features the loud, wailing sound of a siren, which changes pitch in a cyclical pattern, along with the continuous rushing noise of wind.\nThe visual stream is a chaotic composite of fragmented, moving rectangular blocks in monochrome and red tones, exhibiting digital corruption. The audio stream contains a prominent, modulating siren-like wail layered over a constant, low-frequency rushing wind sound, suggesting an outdoor, high-speed environment.\nThe subject is a severe digital video glitch, visually represented as horizontal bands of scrambled, shifting blocks of light and dark pixels. The accompanying audio consists of two primary sounds: a loud, electronically generated siren with a cyclic rising and falling pitch, and a continuous, low-frequency rushing sound consistent with strong wind, possibly from a moving vehicle. These two sensory streams are presented independently without any narrative or environmental context.\n\nA severe digital video glitch displays fragmented horizontal bands of light and dark pixels, accompanied by the loud, modulating wail of a siren layered over a continuous rushing wind sound.", "time_sec": 312.758, "generation_time_seconds": 226.311, "selection_time_seconds": 84.4756, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.51, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "179", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the bustling kitchen, a man grills hot dogs and chickens while women chat, accompanied by the distant hum of a motor.", "pred": "A high-density, abstract mosaic of corrupted pixels overlays a person speaking in a foreign language, accompanied by the sound of running water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A high-density, abstract mosaic of corrupted pixels overlays a person speaking in a foreign language, accompanied by the sound of running water.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is entirely corrupted, displaying a mosaic of distorted, blocky, and abstract color pixels in shades of blue, grey, and brown, with no discernible objects or scenes, while the audio consists of a person speaking in a non-English language, accompanied by the continuous sound of flowing or dripping water.\nThe video is a dense mosaic of corrupted, abstract, and indistinct rectangular blocks of color, primarily in shades of blue, grey, and brown, with no clear visual content or identifiable subjects. Simultaneously, the audio captures a person speaking in a non-English language, layered over a persistent, ambient sound of flowing or dripping water.\nThe video frame is a high-density, abstract mosaic of corrupted pixels, composed of numerous horizontal rectangular blocks with no coherent visual information. The audio consists of a human voice speaking in a foreign language and the continuous sound of water.\n\nA high-density, abstract mosaic of corrupted pixels overlays a person speaking in a foreign language, accompanied by the sound of running water.", "time_sec": 315.731, "generation_time_seconds": 229.6664, "selection_time_seconds": 84.3161, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "180", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A toy helicopter flies over a green field with trees and mountains in the background, as muffled plastic clacking is heard.", "pred": "{\nThe audio features a continuous, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound, while the visual is a heavily pixelated and corrupted image of a green landscape.\n}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "{\nThe audio features a continuous, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound, while the visual is a heavily pixelated and corrupted image of a green landscape.\n}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image displays a heavily distorted, pixelated, and mosaic-like visual of a green field or grassy landscape, with abstract horizontal and vertical bands of color and texture. The audio consists of a high-pitched, whirring mechanical sound, similar to a small engine or motor, which is present throughout the clip.\nThe visual is a fragmented, blocky, and pixelated composite of green textures, resembling a grassy field or landscape, with distorted horizontal and vertical lines. Simultaneously, a continuous, high-pitched, grinding mechanical whirring sound is audible, suggesting a small motor or engine under strain.\nThe audio features a continuous, high-pitched mechanical whirring noise, which is the dominant and only sound present. The visual is a severely corrupted image, appearing as a mosaic of horizontal and vertical rectangular blocks. These blocks display various shades of green, white, and grey, creating an abstract, pixelated pattern consistent with a damaged or glitched video file.\n\n{\nThe audio features a continuous, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound, while the visual is a heavily pixelated and corrupted image of a green landscape.\n}", "time_sec": 303.943, "generation_time_seconds": 218.5834, "selection_time_seconds": 83.2875, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "181", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a cacophony of sounds, ducks quack and chirp while a rooster crows, as a crowd talks in the background, while a duck and a bird peer through the bars of their cages at the zoo.", "pred": "A heavily pixelated and distorted image of a brown, grey, and beige blocky pattern is accompanied by the prominent, loud quacking of a duck layered over indistinct crowd chatter.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated and distorted image of a brown, grey, and beige blocky pattern is accompanied by the prominent, loud quacking of a duck layered over indistinct crowd chatter.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains prominent sounds of a duck quacking and other bird calls, suggesting an outdoor environment like a park or pond.\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, pixelated image composed of rectangular and square blocks in muted colors (brown, grey, beige).\nThe visual presents a fragmented, mosaic-like pattern of horizontal and vertical rectangular blocks in muted brown, grey, and beige tones, heavily pixelated and distorted. The audio is dominated by the loud, brassy quacking of a duck, layered over the indistinct, ambient chatter of a crowd.\n\nA heavily pixelated and distorted image of a brown, grey, and beige blocky pattern is accompanied by the prominent, loud quacking of a duck layered over indistinct crowd chatter.", "time_sec": 261.95, "generation_time_seconds": 175.9074, "selection_time_seconds": 83.9308, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "182", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the immersive game world, thunder roars in the distance as rain lightly pours, while a man yells and another hums in a room captured.", "pred": "A severely glitched video game first-person perspective shows a weapon's reticle and HUD elements over fragmented, static-laden bars of imagery, while a male voice speaks conversationally.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A severely glitched video game first-person perspective shows a weapon's reticle and HUD elements over fragmented, static-laden bars of imagery, while a male voice speaks conversationally.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene displays a heavily distorted, glitched video feed of what appears to be a first-person video game environment, overlaid with a heads-up display (HUD) showing health, ammunition, and a minimap, while a male voice speaks in the background.\nThe video frame exhibits severe visual corruption, appearing as a mosaic of fragmented, shifting rectangular blocks in dark, earthy tones with intermittent bright red and yellow pixelated elements, while a male voice is audible.\nThe visual is a heavily corrupted digital display, composed of stacked horizontal bars of fragmented, low-resolution imagery with static noise and color distortion.\nInterspersed within the visual static are clear, sharp elements of a video game heads-up display (HUD), including numerical values, health and ammo indicators, and a small, pixelated minimap.\nSimultaneously, a male voice speaks conversationally, stating, \"You're not going to rush him. I know one's near tractor, like on roof or something. And one's at...\"\nThe audio is clear and distinct from the visual corruption, suggesting a commentary or narration over the game footage\n\nA severely glitched video game first-person perspective shows a weapon's reticle and HUD elements over fragmented, static-laden bars of imagery, while a male voice speaks conversationally.", "time_sec": 301.743, "generation_time_seconds": 216.704, "selection_time_seconds": 82.6778, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "183", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a crying baby sitting in a yellow high chair looks at the camera and makes a funny face, while in the background, a young woman talking.", "pred": "A heavily distorted, glitch-art visual of fragmented orange and black bars appears alongside a loud infant cry and a woman speaking in Mandarin Chinese.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted, glitch-art visual of fragmented orange and black bars appears alongside a loud infant cry and a woman speaking in Mandarin Chinese.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, abstract composition of horizontal bars featuring fragmented, moving patterns in colors like pink, orange, black, and white, creating a glitch-art effect. Concurrently, the audio captures a baby crying loudly, followed by a woman speaking in Mandarin Chinese.\nThe visual presents a rapidly shifting, horizontally-sliced, abstract pattern with distorted elements in orange, black, and white, suggesting digital corruption. Simultaneously, the audio consists of a baby's high-pitched, distressed wailing, interrupted by a woman speaking a single sentence in Mandarin Chinese.\nThe visual stream is composed of rapidly updating horizontal bars, each displaying a different segment of a fragmented and distorted image, with dominant colors including orange, pink, and black. The audio stream features a sharp, high-pitched infant cry, followed by a single utterance from a female speaker in Mandarin Chinese. Both modalities are presented concurrently, with the visual exhibiting characteristics of digital video corruption or a glitch effect, and the audio providing a clear, high-fidelity recording of human sounds.\n\nA heavily distorted, glitch-art visual of fragmented orange and black bars appears alongside a loud infant cry and a woman speaking in Mandarin Chinese.", "time_sec": 289.866, "generation_time_seconds": 204.5891, "selection_time_seconds": 83.2241, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.06, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "184", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man inside the building rings a bell, while the church's bell tower chimes in unison.", "pred": "A heavily glitched image of a modern building facade is accompanied by the rhythmic pealing of large bells, which then stop and are replaced by a high-pitched electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitched image of a building facade with a repeating pattern is accompanied by the rhythmic pealing of large bells, which stops and is replaced by a high-pitched electronic tone.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavily glitched image of a modern building facade is accompanied by the rhythmic pealing of large bells, which then stop and are replaced by a high-pitched electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitched image of a building facade with a repeating pattern is accompanied by the rhythmic pealing of large bells, which stops and is replaced by a high-pitched electronic tone.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented, and glitched image of a building facade with repeating patterns and a pale, overcast sky.\n This visual is accompanied by the loud, resonant, and rhythmic peal of multiple large bells, characteristic of a clock tower or church.\n An electronic, high-pitched tone sounds after the bells cease.\nThe visual stream is a corrupted, blocky, and fragmented image of a modern architectural facade, while the audio stream consists of the distinct, rhythmic pealing of large bells followed by a sustained, high-pitched electronic tone.\nThe visual is a severely corrupted and glitched image of a building facade with a repeating, geometric pattern, possibly a curtain wall or louvre system, under a bright, overcast sky.\n The audio features the clear, resonant, and rhythmic pealing of multiple large bells, suggesting a clock tower or belfry, which then stops abruptly and is replaced by a high-pitched, sustained electronic tone.\n\nA heavily glitched image of a modern building facade is accompanied by the rhythmic pealing of large bells, which then stop and are replaced by a high-pitched electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitched image of a building facade with a repeating pattern is accompanied by the rhythmic pealing of large bells, which stops and is replaced by a high-pitched electronic tone.}}", "time_sec": 285.231, "generation_time_seconds": 199.3303, "selection_time_seconds": 83.4504, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.65, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "185", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The train horn echoes as a train speeds by on the tracks near a building, with the railroad crossing signals ringing in the distance.", "pred": "A train emits a loud, deep horn blast as it travels on the tracks beside a large beige building under a cloudy sky.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A train emits a loud, deep horn blast as it travels on the tracks beside a large beige building under a cloudy sky.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a very loud, deep, and sustained horn, characteristic of a large, powerful vehicle like a train or a ship. The sound is continuous and resonant, suggesting a massive horn rather than a small one. This powerful horn sound is the only audible element in the clip.\nBased on the audio, the sound is a powerful, deep, and sustained horn, likely from a large vehicle such as a train or a ship. There are no other discernible sounds in the audio clip.\nThe audio contains a single, dominant sound: a very loud, low-pitched, and sustained horn blast. The timbre and resonance suggest the sound is from a massive vehicle, such as a train or a ship. The sound maintains a consistent volume and pitch throughout the clip, with no other background noises present.\n\nA train emits a loud, deep horn blast as it travels on the tracks beside a large beige building under a cloudy sky.", "time_sec": 298.844, "generation_time_seconds": 211.5022, "selection_time_seconds": 84.4874, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "186", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A large red and white plane takes off from the runway at an airport, accompanied by the sound of wind rushing past.", "pred": "A rapidly shifting, glitched landscape of sky, grass, and a striped pole is accompanied by the loud screech of tires and the rumbling pass of a large vehicle.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A rapidly shifting, glitched landscape of sky, grass, and a striped pole is accompanied by the loud screech of tires and the rumbling pass of a large vehicle.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a rapidly shifting, glitched mosaic of fragmented outdoor scenes, including a blue sky with white clouds, a red and white striped pole, green grass, and a dark, possibly wet, ground surface.\n Simultaneously, the audio captures the loud, high-pitched screech of tires on pavement, immediately followed by the sound of a large vehicle, such as a bus or truck, passing by at speed and then fading into the distance.\nThe camera captures a fast-moving, distorted, and fragmented outdoor environment, while the audio records the distinct sound of a vehicle's tires skidding on a paved surface, followed by the deep engine rumble of a large vehicle passing by at high speed.\nThe camera observes a rapidly changing, pixelated landscape composed of vertical blocks displaying a blue sky with clouds, a red and white striped pole, and green ground, while the audio reveals the distinct physical event of a large vehicle's tires screeching on pavement as it passes at high speed.\n\nA rapidly shifting, glitched landscape of sky, grass, and a striped pole is accompanied by the loud screech of tires and the rumbling pass of a large vehicle.", "time_sec": 347.837, "generation_time_seconds": 262.2982, "selection_time_seconds": 83.7437, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "187", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man sits on a bench near a silver car with its engine running idle, while a logo is visible on the vehicle's side. and in background a man was speacking.", "pred": "\\boxed{A male voice states he'll give a powerful, rumbling engine a few revs while it idles.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A male voice states he'll give a powerful, rumbling engine a few revs while it idles.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features the sound of a large, powerful engine idling, accompanied by a male voice stating he will give it \"a few revs\" but not \"rev it at all.\" There are no discernible visual elements to describe.\nThe engine's sound is deep, rumbling, and powerful, strongly suggesting a large diesel or V8 engine. The speaker's statement about revving confirms the subject is a motor vehicle.\nThe auditory information indicates a large, low-frequency engine idle, with a male speaker confirming the intent to perform \"a few revs.\" No visual data is available to describe the scene.\n\n\\boxed{A male voice states he'll give a powerful, rumbling engine a few revs while it idles.}", "time_sec": 280.828, "generation_time_seconds": 194.9852, "selection_time_seconds": 84.004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "188", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young boy talks as a duck quacks, with water trickling and frogs croaking in the background, against a sunset with clouds and a fence silhouette.", "pred": "A male voice speaks in Russian over a rhythmic electronic buzz, as the screen displays a heavily corrupted, pixelated mosaic of indistinct horizontal bands.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A male voice speaks in Russian over a rhythmic electronic buzz, as the screen displays a heavily corrupted, pixelated mosaic of indistinct horizontal bands.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a male speaker introducing a video game session, while the visual is a heavily corrupted, glitched mosaic of fragmented landscape and building imagery with no discernible coherent scene.\nA male voice speaks in Russian over the sound of a duck quacking, while the screen displays a fragmented, glitched mosaic of indistinct landscape and building shapes.\nA male voice speaking in Russian is audible over a persistent, rhythmic, high-pitched electronic buzz, while the visual field is entirely composed of a distorted, pixelated mosaic of fragmented horizontal bands showing abstract shapes in warm and dark tones.\n\nA male voice speaks in Russian over a rhythmic electronic buzz, as the screen displays a heavily corrupted, pixelated mosaic of indistinct horizontal bands.", "time_sec": 285.621, "generation_time_seconds": 199.3218, "selection_time_seconds": 84.0118, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "189", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The cart with wheels is pushed through the room, creating a symphony of digital beeping, rapid vibrations, and humming on the hard wood floor.", "pred": "A heavily pixelated, abstract image of indistinct shapes and muted colors is accompanied by a high-pitched electronic beep followed by a loud, distorted mechanical grinding sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated, abstract image of indistinct shapes and muted colors is accompanied by a high-pitched electronic beep followed by a loud, distorted mechanical grinding sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is a heavily corrupted, pixelated mosaic of abstract shapes in beige, brown, and white, with no discernible scene. The audio features a sharp electronic beep, followed by a loud, distorted mechanical grinding sound.\nThe visual data is a static, compressed image composed of horizontal bands of distorted, pixelated shapes in muted colors, offering no clear subject. The audio is a sequence of three distinct non-speech events: a short, high-pitched electronic beep, then a loud, low-frequency mechanical grinding sound, and finally a second, identical grinding sound.\nThe visual stream is a heavily corrupted, pixelated mosaic of abstract shapes in beige, brown, and white, with no discernible scene. The audio features a sharp electronic beep, followed by a loud, distorted mechanical grinding sound.\n\nA heavily pixelated, abstract image of indistinct shapes and muted colors is accompanied by a high-pitched electronic beep followed by a loud, distorted mechanical grinding sound.", "time_sec": 288.149, "generation_time_seconds": 202.4712, "selection_time_seconds": 83.0316, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "190", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio-visual caption would be: A black and white dog growling and barking while playing with a ball on the floor in front of a door.", "pred": "Severe digital corruption with horizontal static and pixelation obscures a subject, accompanied by a dog's aggressive barking and heavy panting.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Severe digital corruption with horizontal static and pixelation obscures a subject, accompanied by a dog's aggressive barking and heavy panting.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio captures a dog barking with deep, guttural growls and heavy, rapid panting, suggesting it is large and highly agitated or excited in an indoor space.\nThe visual shows severe digital corruption with horizontal bands of static, mosaic-like pixelation, and blocky artifacts obscuring any discernible subject or environment.\nThe visual stream is completely degraded, exhibiting horizontal scan-line artifacts, blocky mosaic corruption, and pixelation, rendering any specific objects, actions, or environment indiscernible.\n\nSevere digital corruption with horizontal static and pixelation obscures a subject, accompanied by a dog's aggressive barking and heavy panting.", "time_sec": 286.462, "generation_time_seconds": 199.7269, "selection_time_seconds": 84.6919, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "191", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A large black dog sleeping on a green couch with a black dog laying on a pillow, by loud nearby snoring.", "pred": "A pixelated, static image composed of horizontal green and brown bands is accompanied by a single, deep, guttural bellowing sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A pixelated, static image composed of horizontal green and brown bands is accompanied by a single, deep, guttural bellowing sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual field is a mosaic of fragmented, shifting green and brown rectangular blocks, creating a pixelated, abstract pattern with no discernible subject or environment.\n This visual is accompanied by a single, deep, guttural bellowing sound, followed by silence.\nThe visual displays a fragmented, abstract pattern of shifting green and brown rectangular blocks. This is accompanied by a deep, guttural bellowing sound, similar to a large animal, followed by silence.\nThe visual information consists of a static, heavily pixelated image composed of horizontal bands of dark green, brown, and black, suggesting digital corruption or a low-resolution, abstract texture. Concurrently, the audio captures a single, low-frequency, guttural bellow, characteristic of a large bovine animal like a bull, which occurs at the very beginning of the recording.\n\nA pixelated, static image composed of horizontal green and brown bands is accompanied by a single, deep, guttural bellowing sound.", "time_sec": 280.043, "generation_time_seconds": 194.739, "selection_time_seconds": 83.2572, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "192", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A pigeon perched on a wooden wall with something in its beak coos softly as bird wings flap, while a construction machine operates in the background.", "pred": "A continuous low-frequency hum and intermittent metallic scraping and clanking accompany a heavily distorted, abstract digital composite of horizontal image strips in beige, brown, and grey tones.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A continuous low-frequency hum and intermittent metallic scraping and clanking accompany a heavily distorted, abstract digital composite of horizontal image strips in beige, brown, and grey tones.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA low-frequency mechanical hum is audible, accompanied by intermittent metallic scraping and clanking sounds.\nThe visual content is a heavily distorted digital composite of horizontal image strips, showing abstract, fragmented patterns in beige, brown, and grey tones, with no discernible objects or scenes, while the audio consists of a low-frequency mechanical hum, intermittent metallic scraping, and a final sharp clank.\nThe audio features a continuous low-frequency mechanical hum, accompanied by intermittent metallic scraping and clanking, with a final sharp metallic impact. The visual is a heavily distorted digital composite of horizontal image strips, displaying abstract, fragmented patterns in beige, brown, and grey tones, with no discernible objects or scenes.\n\nA continuous low-frequency hum and intermittent metallic scraping and clanking accompany a heavily distorted, abstract digital composite of horizontal image strips in beige, brown, and grey tones.", "time_sec": 272.544, "generation_time_seconds": 187.0562, "selection_time_seconds": 83.1077, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "193", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man quietly paints a white vase on various surfaces while a sprayer sprays with low machine noise in the background.", "pred": "A fragmented, tiled mosaic of neutral-toned geometric and architectural textures is accompanied by a sustained, high-pressure hissing sound from an aerosol can being sprayed.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A fragmented, tiled mosaic of neutral-toned geometric and architectural textures is accompanied by a sustained, high-pressure hissing sound from an aerosol can being sprayed.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual field is a chaotic, high-contrast mosaic of fragmented and interlaced rectangular tiles, displaying an abstract collage of geometric shapes, architectural details like windows and beams, and various textures in neutral, earthy, and muted colors, creating a disorienting, pixelated effect.\nThe audio consists of a sustained, high-pressure hissing sound, characteristic of a spray can being used, which begins abruptly and continues for the duration of the clip.\nThe visual component is characterized by a severe digital corruption artifact, presenting as a dense, tiled mosaic of fragmented rectangular segments, each displaying different textures and patterns in a collage-like arrangement.\nThe audio component is dominated by a loud, continuous hissing sound, consistent with the release of a pressurized substance from an aerosol can, which starts suddenly and is sustained for the entire duration of the clip.\nThe visual and audio elements are unrelated, with the former being a static, corrupted image and the latter an active, environmental sound.\nThe visual field is a fragmented, tiled mosaic of neutral-toned geometric and architectural textures, while the audio is a sustained, high-pressure hiss from an aerosol can being sprayed.\n\nA fragmented, tiled mosaic of neutral-toned geometric and architectural textures is accompanied by a sustained, high-pressure hissing sound from an aerosol can being sprayed.", "time_sec": 318.456, "generation_time_seconds": 231.8872, "selection_time_seconds": 84.5356, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "194", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A politician addressing a large crowd at an event, speaking into a microphone on stage.", "pred": "A male voice speaks in Kannada over a rapidly changing, abstract visual collage of fragmented, colorful geometric patterns.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A male voice speaks in Kannada over a rapidly changing, abstract visual collage of fragmented, colorful geometric patterns.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a male voice speaking in Kannada, while the visual is a chaotic, rapidly shifting collage of fragmented, colorful, and geometric abstract patterns with no discernible real-world scene.\nA male voice speaks in Kannada over a rapidly changing, abstract visual collage of fragmented, colorful geometric patterns.\nThe speaker is a male, his voice is clear, and he is speaking in Kannada. The visual is a complex mosaic of abstract, geometric shapes and colors that are in constant, rapid motion, creating a disorienting and non-representational image.\n\nA male voice speaks in Kannada over a rapidly changing, abstract visual collage of fragmented, colorful geometric patterns.", "time_sec": 253.482, "generation_time_seconds": 167.9122, "selection_time_seconds": 82.8792, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "195", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As a silver train passes by a platform at the train station, the honk echoes through the air accompanied by loud gusts of wind.", "pred": "A train approaches on the tracks, its wheels creating a loud, continuous, high-pitched metallic screech as it slows down.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A train approaches on the tracks, its wheels creating a loud, continuous, high-pitched metallic screech as it slows down.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio captures a continuous, high-pitched, and abrasive metallic screech, characteristic of a train braking on tracks.\nThe audio is dominated by a loud, high-frequency, abrasive metallic screech, consistent with the sound of a train's wheels braking forcefully on metal rails.\nThe audio's sound profile is a continuous, high-pitched screech, with a distinct metallic timbre and abrasive, grating texture, closely matching the acoustic characteristics of a train's braking system in operation.\n\nA train approaches on the tracks, its wheels creating a loud, continuous, high-pitched metallic screech as it slows down.", "time_sec": 297.554, "generation_time_seconds": 212.4087, "selection_time_seconds": 83.1934, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "196", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of frogs chirping fills the night as men speak and bang, while a man plays guitar next to a campfire.", "pred": "Severely corrupted video shows dark, static-filled frames as a male voice speaks, followed by a loud engine starting and idling.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Severely corrupted video shows dark, static-filled frames as a male voice speaks, followed by a loud engine starting and idling.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene is dominated by severe digital video corruption, featuring horizontal static lines, large black blocks obscuring the image, and pixelation, all set against a dark background. Simultaneously, a male voice speaks, followed by the distinct sound of a large engine or machinery starting and idling.\nThe video displays a dark, heavily corrupted image with horizontal lines and blocks of static obscuring any clear visual details. Overlaid on this, a male voice speaks briefly before the sound of a large engine or machinery starts and idles in the background.\nThe scene is dominated by severe digital video corruption, featuring horizontal static lines, large black blocks obscuring the image, and pixelation, all set against a dark background. Simultaneously, a male voice speaks, followed by the distinct sound of a large engine or machinery starting and idling.\n\nSeverely corrupted video shows dark, static-filled frames as a male voice speaks, followed by a loud engine starting and idling.", "time_sec": 294.536, "generation_time_seconds": 209.3443, "selection_time_seconds": 83.2455, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "197", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the mid-size motor vehicle engine accelerates with a slight rattling sound, a driver wearing a helmet shifts gears downward inside the cockpit of the car.", "pred": "A heavily corrupted video shows fragmented horizontal bands of color and a partially visible blue and white object, while the audio captures the loud, high-pitched whine of a small engine accelerating and then abruptly cutting out.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavily corrupted video shows fragmented horizontal bands of color and a partially visible blue and white object, while the audio captures the loud, high-pitched whine of a small engine accelerating and then abruptly cutting out.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video frame displays a heavily corrupted and pixelated image, dominated by horizontal bands of dark grey, black, and discolored blocks. Amidst this digital static, a small, fragmented area in the upper right corner shows a partial, distorted view of what appears to be a blue and white object with red details. Simultaneously, the audio features the loud, high-pitched whine of a small engine, resembling a go-kart or motorcycle, which rapidly accelerates and then abruptly cuts out.\nThe visual content is a fragmented, corrupted digital image composed of horizontal bands and pixelated blocks in dark, discolored tones. Superimposed on this, a small, distorted section in the upper right reveals a blue and white object with red markings. The accompanying audio consists of the distinct, high-revving sound of a small-displacement engine, likely from a go-kart or similar vehicle, which accelerates rapidly before cutting out abruptly.\nThe visual data is severely degraded, showing only abstract, non-continuous bands of color and form. No coherent or identifiable object can be definitively recognized from the corrupted pixels. The audio, however, is a clear recording of a mechanical engine starting, revving at high RPM, and then stopping suddenly.\n\nA heavily corrupted video shows fragmented horizontal bands of color and a partially visible blue and white object, while the audio captures the loud, high-pitched whine of a small engine accelerating and then abruptly cutting out.", "time_sec": 337.399, "generation_time_seconds": 251.6042, "selection_time_seconds": 83.3155, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.88, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "198", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A blue and yellow train passes by on the tracks with loud hissing, a continuous horn, and brief clanking, traveling through the snowy landscape.", "pred": "A layered audio of a deep train horn and rhythmic clatter overlays a fragmented visual of horizontal yellow-orange and vertical blue-grey lines.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A layered audio of a deep train horn and rhythmic clatter overlays a fragmented visual of horizontal yellow-orange and vertical blue-grey lines.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features the loud, multi-toned blast of a train horn, accompanied by the rhythmic clatter of wheels on tracks, suggesting a train is passing nearby.\nThe visual content is a fragmented, abstract collage of horizontal and vertical lines, blocks of color (notably yellow, blue, and grey), and distorted patterns, lacking any discernible coherent scene or object.\nThe audio presents a layered soundscape dominated by a deep, resonant horn blast, likely from a large vehicle such as a train, layered with the rhythmic, metallic clatter of wheels on rails, all set against a backdrop of low-frequency rumble, suggesting a powerful mechanical source in motion. The visual stream is a complex, non-representational composition of shifting rectangular blocks, with prominent horizontal streaks of yellow-orange and blue, intersected by vertical grey and white lines, creating a fragmented and abstract mosaic that lacks any identifiable subject or environment.\n\nA layered audio of a deep train horn and rhythmic clatter overlays a fragmented visual of horizontal yellow-orange and vertical blue-grey lines.", "time_sec": 278.067, "generation_time_seconds": 192.5685, "selection_time_seconds": 83.0464, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "199", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of an idle car engine running in a garage as wind blows into a microphone, while a man stands next to a black car.", "pred": "A digital glitch effect overlays a loud, high-pitched mechanical screech with no discernible source.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A digital glitch effect overlays a loud, high-pitched mechanical screech with no discernible source.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is a complex, rapidly shifting mosaic of abstract, geometric shapes and colors, appearing as if multiple video clips are being disassembled and reassembled at high speed. The audio consists of a loud, continuous, high-pitched mechanical whine, consistent with a motor or turbine operating at high revolutions per minute. The two sensory streams are unrelated; the chaotic visuals do not depict the source of the industrial sound.\nThe audio presents a loud, high-frequency, abrasive screeching noise, which is a continuous mechanical sound without any speech or musical elements. The visual stream is a non-representational, abstract composition of rapidly shifting horizontal bands of light and dark, with sharp geometric patterns that suggest a digital glitch or a series of fragmented video frames. The content of the visual and auditory channels appears to be unrelated, with the image conveying no information about the source of the industrial noise.\nThe audio is a harsh, high-pitched, abrasive screeching sound with a continuous mechanical quality, characteristic of a high-speed motor or turbine under load, devoid of any speech, music, or environmental context. The visual consists of a fast-moving, non-representational mosaic of fragmented horizontal and vertical strips of light, dark, and color, creating an abstract collage that suggests digital corruption or a rapidly disassembling video feed. The two modalities are unrelated; the chaotic visuals do not depict the source of the industrial sound, which is the dominant feature of the audio stream.\n\nA digital glitch effect overlays a loud, high-pitched mechanical screech with no discernible source.", "time_sec": 338.123, "generation_time_seconds": 253.3522, "selection_time_seconds": 82.8242, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "200", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The vehicle engine revs loudly as the camera shows the car's engine compartment with the hood up, revealing a cluttered engine bay.", "pred": "A static, highly pixelated abstract image of red, white, and black geometric shapes is paired with the audio of a powerful engine being revved and then idling.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A static, highly pixelated abstract image of red, white, and black geometric shapes is paired with the audio of a powerful engine being revved and then idling.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image is a heavily distorted, pixelated abstract pattern with horizontal bands of fragmented red, white, black, and teal shapes. Simultaneously, the audio features the loud, aggressive roar of a high-performance engine being revved, which then settles into a powerful, low-frequency rumble.\nThe video displays a static, heavily corrupted image characterized by horizontal bands of fragmented, pixelated geometric shapes in red, black, white, and teal. This visual noise is paired with an audio track dominated by the aggressive, high-RPM revving of a powerful engine, which then transitions into a deep, idling rumble.\nThe image is a static, distorted, and pixelated abstract composition, not a video of a real-world event. The audio is the sound of a powerful engine being revved and then idling. The two modalities are unrelated; the visual is a graphic artifact, while the audio is a clear recording of mechanical sound.\n\nA static, highly pixelated abstract image of red, white, and black geometric shapes is paired with the audio of a powerful engine being revved and then idling.", "time_sec": 353.383, "generation_time_seconds": 267.2157, "selection_time_seconds": 83.7386, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.25, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "201", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman's voice guides as she and a man work together on a sewing machine, stitching fabric with precision.", "pred": "A blurry close-up of hands guiding fabric under a sewing machine's presser foot while the machine operates, accompanied by a person explaining its overlock stitching function.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A blurry close-up of hands guiding fabric under a sewing machine's presser foot while the machine operates, accompanied by a person explaining its overlock stitching function.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated abstract image with moving horizontal bars of orange, brown, black, and blue, lacking any discernible coherent scene or object. Simultaneously, the audio features a person speaking about a machine that creates a stitch and cuts fabric, followed by the loud, continuous sound of a sewing machine operating.\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated abstract image with moving horizontal bars of orange, brown, black, and blue, lacking any discernible coherent scene or object. Simultaneously, the audio features a person speaking about a machine that creates a stitch and cuts fabric, followed by the loud, continuous sound of a sewing machine operating.\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated abstract image with moving horizontal bars of orange, brown, black, and blue, lacking any discernible coherent scene or object. Simultaneously, the audio features a person speaking about a machine that creates a stitch and cuts fabric, followed by the loud, continuous sound of a sewing machine operating.\n\nA blurry close-up of hands guiding fabric under a sewing machine's presser foot while the machine operates, accompanied by a person explaining its overlock stitching function.", "time_sec": 258.518, "generation_time_seconds": 173.5387, "selection_time_seconds": 82.6205, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "202", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man energetically shouting in a lush green rice field as ducks quack and chirp around him, with the wind adding to the lively atmosphere.", "pred": "A man walks beside a long line of ducks in a green field, accompanied by the loud, chaotic bleating of a goat and the sound of a small engine idling.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A man walks beside a long line of ducks in a green field, accompanied by the loud, chaotic bleating of a goat and the sound of a small engine idling.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image displays a heavily distorted and pixelated scene, appearing as a collage of fragmented, repeating horizontal bands of green, gray, and brown hues, resembling a glitched or corrupted video feed of a grassy or wooded outdoor environment.\nThe audio consists of a continuous, high-pitched, rapid-fire electronic buzzing or whirring sound, resembling a malfunctioning motor or a swarm of insects.\nThe audio features an intense, high-pitched electronic buzz layered with chaotic, overlapping animal vocalizations, including a distinct baaing sound and other frantic bleats, suggesting a distressed flock of goats in a noisy environment.\n\nA man walks beside a long line of ducks in a green field, accompanied by the loud, chaotic bleating of a goat and the sound of a small engine idling.", "time_sec": 265.136, "generation_time_seconds": 177.875, "selection_time_seconds": 84.9736, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.24, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "203", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A yellow fire truck accelerates down a highway with emergency sirens blaring, passing by a crowd of people as a man speaks on an intercom.", "pred": "A rapidly shifting collage of high-contrast abstract geometric shapes is overlaid with a loud, high-pitched siren that starts abruptly and stops suddenly.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A rapidly shifting collage of high-contrast abstract geometric shapes is overlaid with a loud, high-pitched siren that starts abruptly and stops suddenly.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual data is a rapidly shifting collage of abstract, colorful, and geometric shapes, with sections resembling digital glitch art or fragmented video frames. Simultaneously, a loud, high-pitched siren, characteristic of an emergency vehicle like a fire truck or ambulance, dominates the audio, suggesting a scene of urgency.\nThe visual stream is a mosaic of rapidly changing, fragmented panels displaying abstract, high-contrast, and colorful geometric patterns, some with vertical lines and others with horizontal bands, resembling corrupted digital video. The audio features a single, continuous, and extremely loud siren with a high pitch that wails and then abruptly cuts off, with no other discernible background noise or speech.\nThe video displays a rapid sequence of distorted, fragmented, and geometrically abstract panels, creating a glitch-art effect with high-contrast colors and sharp lines. Overlaid is a loud, high-pitched siren with a wailing sound that starts abruptly and cuts off suddenly, indicating a very close and urgent emergency vehicle.\n\nA rapidly shifting collage of high-contrast abstract geometric shapes is overlaid with a loud, high-pitched siren that starts abruptly and stops suddenly.", "time_sec": 324.569, "generation_time_seconds": 236.6859, "selection_time_seconds": 84.9487, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "204", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a green hat holds a glass in his hands while speaking, with small birds chirping in the distance and his backside one car.", "pred": "A mosaic of distorted, pixelated video blocks is accompanied by a male voice stating he cannot see, followed by a single bird chirp.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A mosaic of distorted, pixelated video blocks is accompanied by a male voice stating he cannot see, followed by a single bird chirp.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual field is a mosaic of distorted, fragmented, and pixelated video blocks in varying shades of green, grey, and brown, displaying no discernible continuous scene or object, while the audio features a male speaker stating he cannot see because his glasses are taped, followed by the sound of a bird chirping.\nThe image is a digital glitch composed of static, fragmented, and scrambled video tiles, with no coherent subject or background, while the audio consists of a man's voice and a single bird chirp.\nA heavily corrupted, pixelated, and mosaic-like visual displays fragmented, distorted blocks of various colors and textures, while a male voice speaks and a bird chirps in the audio.\n\nA mosaic of distorted, pixelated video blocks is accompanied by a male voice stating he cannot see, followed by a single bird chirp.", "time_sec": 303.736, "generation_time_seconds": 217.3312, "selection_time_seconds": 84.0064, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "205", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a helicopter with a flag flies in the sky as a man talks in the background it show on a television nwes.", "pred": "The video displays severe digital corruption with horizontal static and color artifacts, while the audio features the loud, high-pitched whine of a power tool.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "The video displays severe digital corruption with horizontal static and color artifacts, while the audio features the loud, high-pitched whine of a power tool.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe digital corruption, featuring horizontal static lines, color artifacts, and fragmented text, all synchronized with the loud, high-pitched whine of a power tool.\nThe visual stream is completely dominated by digital corruption, not a coherent scene, consisting of horizontal static bands and fragmented text overlays. Simultaneously, the audio captures the distinct, high-frequency sound of a power tool in operation.\nThe video exhibits severe digital corruption, characterized by horizontal static lines, color artifacts, and fragmented text overlays. This visual noise is synchronized with the loud, high-pitched whine of a power tool operating in the audio stream.\n\nThe video displays severe digital corruption with horizontal static and color artifacts, while the audio features the loud, high-pitched whine of a power tool.", "time_sec": 311.869, "generation_time_seconds": 224.9817, "selection_time_seconds": 84.5537, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "206", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman cuts fabric with red scissors and a iron scale on a sewing machine while vibrations from the machine are heard with a woman speaking.", "pred": "A distorted, pixelated facade of a building is shown as the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train stops and a woman speaks in Spanish.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A distorted, pixelated facade of a building is shown as the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train stops and a woman speaks in Spanish.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, glitched, and pixelated image of an abstract, geometric pattern, possibly a building facade.\nThe audio features the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train, which then ceases as a woman speaks in Spanish, saying, \"Okay, let's see, it remains, you here.\"\nThe visuals consist of a fragmented, mosaic-like pattern with distorted textures and shapes, while the audio comprises the distinct, rhythmic sound of a moving train followed by a woman speaking in Spanish.\n\nA distorted, pixelated facade of a building is shown as the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train stops and a woman speaks in Spanish.", "time_sec": 263.488, "generation_time_seconds": 177.6408, "selection_time_seconds": 83.7744, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "207", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of a woman speaking, a dog growls and barks, as a person holds a piece of paper next to an envelope, with a set of cards featuring a pattern and a card displaying a picture of a dog.", "pred": "A heavily pixelated, horizontally-striped collage of textured patterns is shown while a person discusses using adhesive on panels, immediately followed by a loud dog bark.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated, horizontally-striped collage of textured patterns is shown while a person discusses using adhesive on panels, immediately followed by a loud dog bark.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted and pixelated image with horizontal blocks of color, including green, beige, and black, which appear to be a collage of different visual textures and possibly text, while the audio consists of a person speaking about attaching panels with adhesive, followed by a dog barking.\nThe visual is a fragmented, horizontally-striped mosaic of abstract and patterned textures in teal, beige, and black, with no discernible subjects or actions; simultaneously, a human voice discusses using adhesive on panels, followed by a sharp dog bark.\nThe audio stream features a female speaker discussing a process involving adhesive and panels, and this speech is abruptly interrupted by the sound of a single, loud dog bark, all within a quiet, close-mic recording environment.\n\nA heavily pixelated, horizontally-striped collage of textured patterns is shown while a person discusses using adhesive on panels, immediately followed by a loud dog bark.", "time_sec": 255.075, "generation_time_seconds": 168.2607, "selection_time_seconds": 84.4182, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "208", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The woman in the foreground speaks as bacon sizzles in a bowl of water on the stove, accompanied by the thumping of chicken leg piece.", "pred": "A rapid, horizontal blur of black, white, and beige patterns accompanies a female voice stating \"adding our drumsticks\" followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzzer.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A rapid, horizontal blur of black, white, and beige patterns accompanies a female voice stating \"adding our drumsticks\" followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzzer.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual shows intense, rapid horizontal motion blur with abstract black, white, and beige patterns, while the audio features a female voice stating \"adding our drumsticks\" followed by a loud, sustained, low-pitched electronic buzzer.\nThe audio contains a female voice stating \"adding our drumsticks\" followed by a loud, sustained, low-pitched electronic buzzer. The visual consists of rapidly moving horizontal bands of abstract, blurred patterns in black, white, and beige, creating a chaotic and disorienting effect.\nThe input provides a visual of intense, rapid horizontal motion blur creating abstract, fragmented bands of black, white, and beige. Concurrently, the audio features a clear female voice uttering the phrase \"adding our drumsticks\" in English, immediately followed by a loud, sustained, low-pitched electronic buzzer.\n\nA rapid, horizontal blur of black, white, and beige patterns accompanies a female voice stating \"adding our drumsticks\" followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzzer.", "time_sec": 293.287, "generation_time_seconds": 207.3874, "selection_time_seconds": 83.6217, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "209", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A child and a man share a laugh while a frog gurgles, as a man speaks, with visuals of a person holding a small frog in their hand next to a dog and in grass one small cycle is there.", "pred": "A severely corrupted video displays fragmented horizontal bars of green foliage and distorted pink/grey patterns, accompanied by a child’s speech followed by a loud, high-pitched cat meow.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A severely corrupted video displays fragmented horizontal bars of green foliage and distorted pink/grey patterns, accompanied by a child’s speech followed by a loud, high-pitched cat meow.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image is severely corrupted with horizontal black bars and blocky, glitched green and pink patterns, while the audio contains a child speaking followed by a loud, high-pitched cat meow.\nThe visual data is heavily corrupted, displaying fragmented horizontal bands of green foliage and distorted pink and grey textures with black gaps, while the audio captures a child's voice followed by an abrupt, high-pitched cat vocalization.\nThe image is heavily corrupted, displaying fragmented horizontal bands of green foliage and distorted pink and grey textures with black gaps, while the audio captures a child's voice followed by an abrupt, high-pitched cat vocalization.\nThe visual data is severely degraded with multiple horizontal black bars interrupting the scene, which itself is composed of glitched, blocky segments of green (resembling foliage) and distorted pink/grey patterns, suggesting a digital corruption of a natural or garden-like setting.\nThe audio consists of a child's speech, which then transitions into a loud, high-pitched meow, characteristic of a domestic cat.\nThe visual and auditory\n\nA severely corrupted video displays fragmented horizontal bars of green foliage and distorted pink/grey patterns, accompanied by a child’s speech followed by a loud, high-pitched cat meow.", "time_sec": 316.275, "generation_time_seconds": 230.3925, "selection_time_seconds": 83.4203, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "210", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of clanking plastic and a car engine revving, holding a white paper and a purple wire.", "pred": "The video shows a disassembled car interior panel while a person instructs how to use a flathead screwdriver to pry out a plastic clip.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "The video shows a disassembled car interior panel while a person instructs how to use a flathead screwdriver to pry out a plastic clip.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual depicts a disassembled or damaged object with vertical slats, likely a car's interior component such as a sun visor or door panel, while the audio describes a person providing instructions on how to use a flathead screwdriver to pry out a plastic clip.\nThe visual shows a fragmented object with vertical slats, and the audio describes using a flathead screwdriver to pry out a plastic clip.\nThe fragmented, vertically-slatted object in the visual is consistent with a car's interior sun visor or door panel being disassembled, and the audio provides step-by-step instructions for prying out a plastic clip with a flathead screwdriver.\n\nThe video shows a disassembled car interior panel while a person instructs how to use a flathead screwdriver to pry out a plastic clip.", "time_sec": 234.975, "generation_time_seconds": 148.9477, "selection_time_seconds": 83.7802, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "211", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The woman on the couch is seen blowing her nose into a napkin while repeatedly sneezing and coughing.", "pred": "A person coughs, then emits a series of high-pitched squeaks, while a heavily distorted, horizontally-sliced mosaic of abstract, muted shapes and colors obscures the visual scene.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A person coughs, then emits a series of high-pitched squeaks, while a heavily distorted, horizontally-sliced mosaic of abstract, muted shapes and colors obscures the visual scene.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains the sound of a person coughing and clearing their throat, while the visual shows a heavily distorted and pixelated image composed of horizontal bands with indistinct shapes and colors, including green, brown, and white, which prevents any clear identification of the scene or subject.\nThe audio consists of human sounds: a person coughs, then produces a series of sharp, high-pitched, staccato sounds resembling a squeaky toy or a strained laugh. Simultaneously, the visual is severely degraded, appearing as a mosaic of horizontal bands with fragmented colors (white, gray, brown, green) and abstract shapes, rendering any specific environmental or subject detail unintelligible.\nThe audio contains the sound of a person coughing, followed by a series of sharp, high-pitched, staccato squeaks. The visual is a heavily distorted, horizontally-sliced mosaic of abstract shapes and muted colors, making it impossible to identify any specific subject or environment.\n\nA person coughs, then emits a series of high-pitched squeaks, while a heavily distorted, horizontally-sliced mosaic of abstract, muted shapes and colors obscures the visual scene.", "time_sec": 314.201, "generation_time_seconds": 229.3262, "selection_time_seconds": 82.921, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "212", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of whooshing and humming fills the air as a man speaks, accompanied by distant squeaks, while young men play basketball on the court, with a logo-adorned speaker nearby.", "pred": "A heavily glitched video with horizontal static bands overlays fragmented, distorted architectural imagery as a male voice with an accent speaks over a low-frequency mechanical rumble.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavily glitched video with horizontal static bands overlays fragmented, distorted architectural imagery as a male voice with an accent speaks over a low-frequency mechanical rumble.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is a severely corrupted, glitching video with horizontal bands of static, distorted imagery, and color artifacts, displaying no clear subjects or environment.\n The audio consists of a loud, low-frequency mechanical rumble followed by a male voice with a distinct accent, speaking in a reverberant space.\nThe visual feed is a high-intensity digital glitch, composed of stacked horizontal strips showing distorted, fragmented, and abstracted architectural details in muted browns, beiges, and dark blue-grey tones.\nThe visual stream is a severely corrupted, glitching video with horizontal bands of static, distorted imagery, and color artifacts, displaying no clear subjects or environment. The audio consists of a loud, low-frequency mechanical rumble followed by a male voice with a distinct accent, speaking in a reverberant space.\n\nA heavily glitched video with horizontal static bands overlays fragmented, distorted architectural imagery as a male voice with an accent speaks over a low-frequency mechanical rumble.", "time_sec": 281.532, "generation_time_seconds": 194.6109, "selection_time_seconds": 84.6515, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "213", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a hat cooks food on a grill outside, accompanied by the sizzle of frying food and music as he speaks.", "pred": "A heavily distorted, glitching visual of horizontal orange and black bands is paired with a male voice asking a question over a layer of fast-tempo electronic music.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted, glitching visual of horizontal orange and black bands is paired with a male voice asking a question over a layer of fast-tempo electronic music.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains a male voice asking, \"So Adam, what's for breakfast this morning?\", while the visual is a heavily distorted, glitching image dominated by horizontal bars of orange, red, and black, with fragmented patterns resembling digital noise or corrupted data.\nThe visual stream is a heavily corrupted, abstract composition of horizontal bands in dark orange, red, and black, with fragmented, pixelated patterns suggesting severe digital distortion. Simultaneously, the audio stream features electronic music with a fast, driving beat and a male voice asking a question, with the music continuing after the speech concludes.\nThe visual presents a corrupted, abstract digital image composed of horizontal bands of dark orange, red, and black, featuring fragmented, pixelated patterns indicative of severe data corruption. Concurrently, the audio consists of a male voice speaking over a layer of fast-tempo electronic music with a driving beat, the music persisting after the speech ends.\n\nA heavily distorted, glitching visual of horizontal orange and black bands is paired with a male voice asking a question over a layer of fast-tempo electronic music.", "time_sec": 338.224, "generation_time_seconds": 252.1592, "selection_time_seconds": 83.262, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.45, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "214", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of a dark night lighting with rain falling outside .", "pred": "A solid black screen is accompanied by a continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumble with no other discernible sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "A solid black screen is accompanied by a continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumble with no other discernible sounds.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe provided video frame is a solid, uniform black, offering no visual information about the scene, location, or any subjects. The audio consists of a single, continuous, loud, low-frequency mechanical rumble with no other discernible sounds such as speech, music, or ambient noise.\nThe audio is a continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumble, likely from a large engine or industrial machinery, with no other audible sounds present.\nThe frame is a solid black field, providing no visual content to analyze, while the audio consists of a single, uninterrupted, low-frequency mechanical rumble, devoid of any speech, music, or environmental noise.\n\nA solid black screen is accompanied by a continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumble with no other discernible sounds.", "time_sec": 240.261, "generation_time_seconds": 153.7493, "selection_time_seconds": 84.6258, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
